spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[36],"translations":{"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null],"en":["Museums and art centers"],"it":["Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"pt":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"en":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The Open Sky Museum is a children's discovery of KANAL's neighbourhood. 100 children and young people aged between 10 and 14 have captured the beauty that surrounds us with the artist Larissa Vanhee. Discover the city through the children's eyes in the Yser metro station and on the palisade of the under construction museum on Quai des P\u00e9niches\/Akenkaai.\n\nThe photo exhibition coincides with the 10th anniversary of ToekomstATELIERdelAvenir, better known as TADA! As a learning network, TADA offers a wide range of creative activities for teenagers in Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, Schaerbeek, Laeken and Molenbeek. Their operation puts resilience and expression at the centre. And sets the learning bar high. TADA opens doors, builds extra bridges in the city and is a breeding ground for talent.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"it":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"cn":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"fr":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Le Mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert est une d\u00e9couverte du quartier de KANAL \u00e0 hauteur d\u2019enfant. 100 enfants et jeunes \u00e2g\u00e9s de 10 \u00e0 14 ans ont captur\u00e9 la beaut\u00e9 qui nous entoure avec l\u2019artiste Larissa Vanhee, qui a pris soin de ces graines d\u2019artistes. D\u00e9couvrez les images du quartier r\u00e9enchant\u00e9 par la curiosit\u00e9 des enfants dans la station de metro Yser et sur la palissade du mus\u00e9e en chantier, situ\u00e9e au quai des P\u00e9niches. \nCette exposition co\u00efncide avec la c\u00e9l\u00e9bration des 10 ans de ToekomstATELIERdelAvenir, plus connue sous le nom de TADA! L\u2019association offre de nombreuses activit\u00e9s cr\u00e9atives \u00e0 Saint-Josse, Schaerbeek et Molenbeek et met au premier plan la vitalit\u00e9 avec laquelle les jeunes saisissent ces opportunit\u00e9s de s\u2019exprimer. TADA, c\u2019est une ouvreuse de portes, un pont de plus dans la ville, une p\u00e9pini\u00e8re de talents! \nLes photographes: Abdoul, Aboubakr, Aissata, Amina, Amira A., Amira, Anas D., Anas M., Antonio, Assile, Ayman, Aymen, Ayoub, Baha, Benito, Billo, Daoud, Diouma, Erla, Farah, Fatou, Gabriela, Ghazia, Giulia, Hiba, Ibrahim, Ilias, Insaf, Isaac, Jennate, Kamila, Kenan, Kledis, Leo, Malak, Mariam, Marius, Matei, Mehdi C., Mehdi H., Mehdi L., Meysenne, Miriam, Moez, Mohammed, Mori, Mouad, Mountacer, Mouslim, Naoufal, Nicolas, Nourdine, Nour B., Nour L., Oumar, Raffaello, Richie, Roa, Roumaysa, Safwan, Sali, Saliou, Salma B., Salma E., Sarah B., Sarah E., Sarah Q., Serine, Silah, Sione, Sophia, Soumaya, Valentina, Vinicius, Yaren, Younes, Youssef, Zahera, Zakaria. \nToekomstATELIERdelAvenir & KANAL-Centre Pompidou","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"sp":{"name":"Le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 ciel ouvert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"},"nl":{"name":"Het openluchtmuseum","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het openluchtmuseum is het resultaat van een ontdekkingstocht door de buurt van KANAL vanuit kinderperspectief. 100 kinderen en jongeren tussen 10 en 14 jaar trokken de stad in, haar schoonheid tegemoet. Kunstenares Larissa Vanhee zette de blik van de jonge kunstenaars op scherp. Meer dan 250 foto\u2019s die getuigen van een nieuwsgierige kijk op de stad. Je vindt er een aantal op de werfomheining rond het toekomstige museum KANAL-Centre Pompidou, aan de Akenkaai vlak aan het kanaal, en in metrostation IJzer. \n\n\nDe fototentoonstelling valt samen met de 10de verjaardag van ToekomstATELIERdelAvenir. Het lerend netwerk - ook wel bekend onder de naam TADA - organiseert een brede waaier aan creatieve activiteiten voor tieners in Sint-Joost-ten-Node, Schaarbeek en Molenbeek. Levenskracht en expressie staan er centraal. TADA opent deuren, bouwt extra stadsbruggen en is een kweekvijver voor talent. \n\nDe fotografen: Abdoul, Aboubakr, Aissata, Amina, Amira A., Amira, Anas D., Anas M., Antonio, Assile, Ayman, Aymen, Ayoub, Baha, Benito, Billo, Daoud, Diouma, Erla, Farah, Fatou, Gabriela, Ghazia, Giulia, Hiba, Ibrahim, Ilias, Insaf, Isaac, Jennate, Kamila, Kenan, Kledis, Leo, Malak, Mariam, Marius, Matei, Mehdi C., Mehdi H., Mehdi L., Meysenne, Miriam, Moez, Mohammed, Mori, Mouad, Mountacer, Mouslim, Naoufal, Nicolas, Nourdine, Nour B., Nour L., Oumar, Raffaello, Richie, Roa, Roumaysa, Safwan, Sali, Saliou, Salma B., Salma E., Sarah B., Sarah E., Sarah Q., Serine, Silah, Sione, Sophia, Soumaya, Valentina, Vinicius, Yaren, Younes, Youssef, Zahera, Zakaria. \nToekomstATELIERdelAvenir & KANAL-Centre Pompidou","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","email":"info@kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000244"}},"place":{"id":271094,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou       ","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Weder auf dem Gebiet der modernen und zeitgen\u00f6ssischen Kunst noch im Bereich der Architektur ist Br\u00fcssel ein unbeschriebenes Blatt. Im Gegenteil, es gibt bereits eine ganze Reihe von Museen und Einrichtungen, die sich mit den verschiedenen k\u00fcnstlerischen Disziplinen besch\u00e4ftigen. \r\nWas jedoch bislang noch fehlte, war ein Museum f\u00fcr moderne und zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst und ein Architekturmuseum unter einem Dach (und was f\u00fcr einem Dach!). Und so hat das ambitionierte Projekt KANAL Centre Pompidou seine absolute Daseinsberechtigung am Br\u00fcsseler Kanal, wo es die 35 000 m\u00b2 der ehemaligen Citro\u00ebn-Werkstatt in Beschlag nehmen wird. In der Zeit bis zum Beginn der Umbauarbeiten, deren Ende f\u00fcr 2022\/2023 geplant sind, hat die Fondation Kanal beschlossen, ab dem 5. Mai 2018 eine Art \"Vorlaufjahr\" zu starten. 13 Monate lang kann das Publikum in Zusammenarbeit mit dem Centre Pompidou dieses mythische Geb\u00e4ude entdecken - Ausstellungen, Gro\u00dfinstallationen, zehn Auftragsarbeiten von Br\u00fcsseler K\u00fcnstlern sowie ein Programm mit Live-Darbietungen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou      ","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"When it reopens in 2024, Kanal-Centre Pompidou will become the largest cultural institution in Brussels, with more than 35,000m\u00b2 dedicated to current artistic creation in all its forms. After presenting KANAL BRUT - an exhibition in its own, raw space - and then a major two-part exhibition by Swiss artist John M Armleder, the huge garage closed its doors for renovation. However, Kanal remains active in the Brussels cultural sector and is multiplying its collaborations with local actors. Exhibitions and events are planned at K1, a space opposite the building site. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou      ","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou      ","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Lors de sa re\u0301ouverture pre\u0301vue en 2024, Kanal-Centre Pompidou deviendra la plus vaste institution culturelle bruxelloise, avec plus de 35.000 m\u00b2 de\u0301die\u0301s a\u0300 la cre\u0301ation artistique actuelle sous toutes ses formes. Apr\u00e8s avoir pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 \u00ab\u202fKANAL BRUT\u202f\u00bb, une exposition dans son espace encore dans son jus, puis une grande exposition en deux volets de l\u2019artiste suisse John M Armleder, l\u2019immense garage a ferm\u00e9 ses portes pour cause de travaux. Kanal reste cependant actif dans le secteur culturel \u00e0 Bruxelles et multiplie ses collaborations avec les acteurs locaux. Des expositions et des \u00e9v\u00e8nements sont notamment pr\u00e9vus au K1, un local faisant face au chantier. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou","address_street_name":"Sainctelettesquare","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Sainctelettesquare","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Wanneer Kanal-Centre Pompidou in 2024 heropent, zal het de grootste culturele instelling in Brussel zijn, met meer dan 35.000 vierkante meter gewijd aan hedendaagse artistieke creatie in al haar vormen. Na de presentatie van \u2018KANAL BRUT,\u2019 een tentoonstelling in de oorspronkelijke ruimte, gevolgd door een grote tweedelige tentoonstelling van de Zwitserse kunstenaar John M. Armleder, sloot de enorme garage haar deuren voor renovatie. Kanal blijft echter actief in de culturele sector in Brussel en intensiveert zijn samenwerking met lokale spelers. Zo zijn er tentoonstellingen en evenementen gepland in K1, een ruimte net tegenover de bouwwerf.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"KANAL - CENTRE POMPIDOU","virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":31094,"location":{"lat":50.85867303,"lon":4.3479144},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2018-03-21T14:36:53+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":271094,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kanal - Centre Pompidou       ","address_street_name":"Square Sainctelette ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kanal.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.kanal.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Square Sainctelette ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Weder auf dem Gebiet der modernen und zeitgen\u00f6ssischen Kunst noch im Bereich der Architektur ist Br\u00fcssel ein unbeschriebenes Blatt. Im Gegenteil, es gibt bereits eine ganze Reihe von Museen und Einrichtungen, die sich mit den verschiedenen k\u00fcnstlerischen Disziplinen besch\u00e4ftigen. \r\nWas jedoch bislang noch fehlte, war ein Museum f\u00fcr moderne und zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst und ein Architekturmuseum unter einem Dach (und was f\u00fcr einem Dach!). Und so hat das ambitionierte Projekt KANAL Centre Pompidou seine absolute Daseinsberechtigung am Br\u00fcsseler Kanal, wo es 