n_web":"As its name suggests, Bazaar Trottoir aims to show the city from its most popular point of view: its pavements. An anchor point like a red thread that unfolds through branded and private walks by theme (girl power, sustainable Brussels, street art, even \"singles only\" walks) or by neighbourhood. A wide range of choices not necessarily available at all times. Don't hesitate to check the agenda available in Dutch to find out about the next themed walks. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Comme son nom l\u2019indique Bazaar Trottoir s\u2019affaire \u00e0 montrer la ville depuis ce qu\u2019elle a de plus populaire\u202f: ses trottoirs. Un point d\u2019ancrage comme un fil rouge qui se d\u00e9roule \u00e0 travers des balades griff\u00e9es et priv\u00e9es par th\u00e9matiques (girl power, Bruxelles durable, street art, jusqu\u2019aux balades \u00ab\u202fsingles only\u202f\u00bb) ou par quartiers. Un large panel de choix pas forc\u00e9ment disponible \u00e0 tout moment. N\u2019h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 checker l\u2019agenda disponible en n\u00e9erlandais pour d\u00e9couvrir les prochaines th\u00e9matique mises \u00e0 l\u2019honneur. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Gand","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Bazaar Trottoir","address_street_name":"Steenweg op Gent","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@bazaartrottoir.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bazaartrottoir.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 26 70 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Steenweg op Gent","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Zoals de naam al doet vermoeden, wil Bazaar Trottoir de stad laten zien vanuit haar meest geliefde gezichtspunt: de trottoirs. Een ankerpunt als een rode draad die zich ontvouwt via merk- en priv\u00e9wandelingen per thema (girl power, duurzaam Brussel, street art, zelfs \"singles only\"-wandelingen) of per buurt. Ee