th a private guide.","longdescr":"Whether you are passing through the capital or staying a bit longer, this private guided tour in Brussels, will give you a great insight on the history of the place and you will discover fascinating hidden secrets. You will be taken to immerse in the city\u2019s culture by first visiting the \u201clower city\u201d and mingle with the locals who are proud in taking you into their community. Then we will head up to the \u201cupper city\u201d to socialize with Brussels nobility. Here you will discover the incredible historical richness of Brussels. Practical information: Price: Private guide service: 190 \u20ac (guided tour of 3 hours \u2013 up to 10 people). 230 \u20ac (guided tour of 3 hours \u2013 up to 15 people). 300 \u20ac (guided tour of 3 hours \u2013 up to 25 people). 310 \u20ac (guided tour of 6 hours \u2013 up to 10 people). 400 \u20ac (guided tour of 6 hours \u2013 up to 15 people). 500 \u20ac (guided tour of 6 hours \u2013 up to 25 people). When: Every day. Starting time: You choose. Meeting point: You decide (The Grand Place in Brussels, in your hotel or anywhere else in Brussels). Duration: 3 hours or 6 hours. Language: The tour is exclusively in English. Included: English speaking guide. Exclusive and private tour. Tours defined according to your needs. Can be included: transport, museum admissions, meals, drinks\u2026 Book one of our packages above or send us a message for more information or for any special request.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539553"},"it":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539553"},"cn":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539553"},"fr":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e de Bruxelles","shortdescr":"Visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e du centre historique de Bruxelles.","longdescr":"Durant notre tour guid\u00e9 du centre historique de Bruxelles, notre guide nous fera d\u00e9couvrir le centre historique de Bruxelles via ses lieux embl\u00e9matiques et insolites tels que la Grand-Place, l\u2019\u00e9glise Saint-Nicolas, le quartier de saint jacques de Compostelle, La galerie Saint Hubert, Le Parc Royal, le Palais Royal et la Place Royale et bien d\u2019autres. Nous parcourrons ses rues sinueuses pav\u00e9es, d\u00e9couvrirons certaines statues populaires tel que le Manneken-Pis et admirerons des monuments sublimes desquelles notre guide passionn\u00e9 nous relatera l\u2019histoire. Informations pratiques : Prix : 190 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 10 personnes). 230 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 15 personnes). 300 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e de 3 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 25 personnes). 310 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 10 personnes). 400 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 15 personnes). 500 \u20ac (visite guid\u00e9e priv\u00e9e de 6 heures \u2013 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 25 personnes). Quand : Tous les jours. Heures de d\u00e9part : \u00c0 vous de choisir. Point de rencontre : \u00c0 vous de choisir : \u00e0 la Grand-Place de Bruxelles, \u00e0 votre h\u00f4tel (tant que celui-ci est situ\u00e9 dans le centre de Bruxelles) ou \u00e0 l\u2019endroit de votre choix au centre-ville de Bruxelles. Dur\u00e9e : 3 heures ou 6 heures. Langue : Fran\u00e7ais Inclus : Guide francophone. Visite priv\u00e9e et personnalis\u00e9e. Circuits d\u00e9finis selon vos besoins. Peuvent \u00eatre inclus : transport, entr\u00e9es aux mus\u00e9es, d\u00e9gustations, repas, boissons, bi\u00e8re, chocolats,\u2026 R\u00e9servez l\u2019une de nos formules ci-dessus ou envoyez-nous un message pour obtenir de plus amples informations ou pour toute demande particuli\u00e8re.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539553"},"sp":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539553"},"nl":{"name":"Visite priv\u00e9e de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539553"}},"place":{"id":275485,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Grand Place, sous l'horloge de l'hotel de ville ","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Grand Place, sous l'horloge de l'hotel de ville ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":