alse,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-09-04T02:01:52+02:00","published_at":"2023-07-24T09:09:48+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":259633,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"tour","ranking":0.12491872559477184,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","es"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","pt":null,"en":"Guided tours","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres, Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"pt":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres, Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"en":{"name":"Flanders beer tour: Flanders Brewing Treasures","shortdescr":"Who can\u2019t be curious about the making of the most renowned alcoholic drink in Belgium and maybe in the world? A drink that makes Belgian\u2019s expertise shine in an international way and which was recognized officially as so with its registration on the UNESCO list! We invite you to the discovery of this tradition during an experience that\u2019s going to make your taste and your eyesight on alert","longdescr":"Program: We will start our excursion from Brussels with our guide and travel through Flanders both Eastern and Western part by minivan\/van\/bus leaving at 8h We will travel in a region which has an international reputation for its romantic landscapes. While leaving the Belgian capital we will be heading to the Huyghe Brewery. You\u2019re maybe already familiar with the brand logo of one of its most famous product, a pink elephant, or its multiple bars throughout Europe, particularly the Delirium bar located in the center of Brussels known to be the bar serving most kinds of beers in the world. Discover its great history through this guided tour that will also allow you to taste its most famous product. They are producing Delirium beer but, also some other famous beer as they have a long history with brewing as they brew since the 17th century. After a journey into Flemish landscapes, you\u2019ll arrive to the Westvleteren Abbey, with its rich history of beer making and countryside environment, it offers picturesque hiking spots that you\u2019ll undertake in order to enjoy the region landscapes to the most allowing you to reconnect with a more natural environment and take a break from the business of a urban life. This walk should have whet your appetite, thus we are going to take you to the \u201cIn de Vrede\u201d restaurant who cook dishes with the Abbey products. This stop will then allow you to discover the region with your eyesight, but also with your taste. You\u2019ll be delighted with the menu proposed that will allow you to get an overview of the abbey\u2019s culinary production. A short journey separates us to our next stop, the Sint Bernardus Brewery and its Hop fields. Hop that is an essential ingredient in the beer-making process that is used during the cooking to give it all its flavors. Thankfully, to the bar situated on the 3rd floor of the building offering a panoramic view, you\u2019ll be able to admire the hop fields which will give you a breathtaking scene we can qualify of unique. In the meantime, you\u2019ll taste their beers, cheese and other delicacies that the region has to propose. Our last journey will be the return to Brussels during which you\u2019ll be able to enjoy the magnificent Flemish landscapes one last time. Finally, we will return to Brussels with an approximate arrival time at 19h. Practical information: Price: Single price for the service of a guide: 340 \u20ac Group of maximum 33 people per guide. Transport costs: Minivan (from 1 to 6 people): 600\u20ac. Bus (from 7 to 15 people): 800\u20ac. Bus (from 16 to 33 people): 1200\u20ac. Tasting price per person: Groups of 1 to 6 people. + 160\u20ac pp. Groups from 7 to 15 people. + 139\u20ac pp. Groups from 16 to 33 people. + 125\u20ac pp. When: Every day. Starting time: You choose. Meeting point: You decide (The Grand Place in Brussels, in your hotel or anywhere else in Brussels). Duration: Approximately 11 hours (can be adapted to your needs). Language: English (also available in French and Spanish). Included: Local English-speaking guide. Exclusive and private tour. Tours defined according to your needs. Can be included: transport, museum admissions, tastings, meals, drinks\u2026","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"it":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres, Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"cn":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres, Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"fr":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres","shortdescr":"Rejoignez nous dans notre exploration du patrimoine brassicole de Flandres et visitez des lieux reconnus li\u00e9s \u00e0 l\u2019h\u00e9ritage brassicole ! Service personnalis\u00e9 et sur mesure: Team-building, voyage d\u2019incentive et tourisme d\u2019affaire.","longdescr":"Qui ne se montrerait pas curieux envers la fabrication de la boisson alcoolis\u00e9e la plus connue de Belgique voire du monde ? Une boisson qui a permis au savoir faire belge de briller de fa\u00e7on internationale et qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 reconnue officiellement comme telle suite \u00e0 son inscription sur la liste du patrimoine de l\u2019UNESCO. Nous vous invitons \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir cette tradition durant cette exp\u00e9rience qui ravira votre vue mais aussi votre go\u00fbt. Bref, cette visite guid\u00e9e vous permettra de comprendre pourquoi la tendance de la bi\u00e8re belge est justifi\u00e9e comment elle a commence et pourquoi elle va continuer. La route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres, inclus la visite de plusieurs brasseries belges connues \u00e0 l\u2019international mais aussi une balade autour d\u2019une Abbaye produisant une bi\u00e8re trappiste ainsi que la d\u00e9gustation de leurs produits. L\u2019environnement dans lequel se d\u00e9roule ce circuit doit aussi \u00eatre mis \u00e0 l\u2019honneur dans ses points forts puisque la Flandre jouit d\u2019une forte r\u00e9putation pour receler de paysages naturellement romantiques. Informations pratiques : Prix : Prix unique pour le service d\u2019un guide : 340 \u20ac Groupe de maximum 33 pers. par guide. Co\u00fbts li\u00e9es au transport : Minivan (de 1 \u00e0 6 pers.) : 600\u20ac Bus (de 7 \u00e0 15 pers.) : 800\u20ac Bus (de 16 \u00e0 33 pers.) : 1200\u20ac Prix de la d\u00e9gustation par personne : Groupes de 1 \u00e0 6 pers.+ 160\u20ac pp. Groupes de 7 \u00e0 15 pers.+ 139\u20ac pp. Groupes de 16 \u00e0 33 pers.+ 125\u20ac pp. Quand : Tous les jours. Heures de d\u00e9part : A vous de choisir (\u00e0 convenir avec le guide). Point de rencontre : A vous de choisir (\u00e0 la Grand-Place de Bruxelles, \u00e0 votre h\u00f4tel ou \u00e0 convenir avec le guide). Dur\u00e9e : Environs 11 heures (s\u2019adapte \u00e0 vos besoins). Langue : Fran\u00e7ais (aussi disponible en anglais et espagnol). Inclus : Guide local francophone. Visite priv\u00e9e et personnalis\u00e9e. Circuits d\u00e9finis selon vos besoins. Peuvent \u00eatre inclus: transport, d\u00e9gustations, entr\u00e9es aux mus\u00e9es, repas, boissons, \u2026 Non inclus: R\u00e9servation : Ce produit est une activit\u00e9 cl\u00e9 en main, le processus de r\u00e9servation est tr\u00e8s simple. Choisissez le jour et les options que vous souhaitez r\u00e9server. C\u2019est tout. Imm\u00e9diatement apr\u00e8s votre paiement, vous recevrez un e-mail de confirmation et l\u2019un de nos responsables de projet vous contactera afin d\u2019adapter l\u2019activit\u00e9 \u00e0 vos besoins et expectatives.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"sp":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres, Belgique","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539633"},"nl":{"name":"Tour de la Route de la bi\u00e8re en Flandres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"perform