026\r\n\r\nDepuis le 1er mai 2017, le Mus\u00e9e royal de l\u2019Arm\u00e9e appartient au War Heritage Institute, la nouvelle institution de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence pour le patrimoine militaire et la m\u00e9moire en Belgique. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Real de la Armada e Historia militar (War Heritage Institute)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El museo posee alrededor de 100.000 objetos(armas, uniformes, maquetas, documentos...), siendo as\u00ed unos de los museos militares m\u00e1s grandes del mundo. Encontrar\u00e1s: una secci\u00f3n de armas y armaduras de la Edad Media, una preciosa colecci\u00f3n del Imperio franc\u00e9s, la Armada belga desde 1831 a 1914 con vitrinas dedicadas al rey Leopoldo l y Leopoldo ll, el desarrollo de la tecnolog\u00eda armament\u00edstica(hacia la mitad del s.XX), la Primera y Segunda Guerra Mundial(uniformes, materiales fotos y documentos), veh\u00edculos armados y barcos de guerra. La secci\u00f3n \"a\u00e9rea\" del museo ofrece una gama completa de aviones, alrededor de 80 son expuestos.\u00a1Y no te pierdas nuestros juegos educativos para todas las \u00e9pocas!. \r\n\r\nLos centros de documentaci\u00f3n est\u00e1n abiertos al p\u00fablico.\r\n\r\nEspectacular vista panor\u00e1mica de la ciudad desde la galer\u00eda.\r\n\r\nLas exposiciones temporales pueden ser de varios temas.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"War Heritage Institute (Koninklijk Legermuseum)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@warheritage.be","website":"http:\/\/www.warheritage.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 737 78 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Meer dan tien eeuwen militaire geschiedenis passeren de revue in dit museum. Je krijgt er een overzicht van de ingrijpende veranderingen die door de jaren heen hebben plaatsgegrepen op het gebied van bewapening en militaire technologie, van de middeleeuwen tot op heden: wapens, harnassen, pantsers, vliegtuigen, uniformen, \u2026\r\n\r\nSinds 1 mei 2017 is het Koninklijk Legermuseum onderdeel van het War Heritage Institute, de nieuwe instelling voor militair erfgoed en herinnering in Belgi\u00eb. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":127,"location":{"lat":50.84086428,"lon":4.39335612},"last_updated_at":"2023-04-13T11:45:06+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/ac0a92ae7c057e003475f02f2b0cccd380ec44fe.jpg","width":6250,"height":3572,"ratio":1.75,"oEmbed_height":3572,"oEmbed_width":6250,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Parcours Manneken-Pis","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-07-01","doors":null,"start":"09:00:00","end":"17:00:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-07-02","