":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"},"en":{"name":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":"20 YEARS OF FARM PROD: An expo-event on and at the initiative of Farm Prod painters collective.","longdescr":"From September 1st til 30th 2023, at LaVall\u00e9e, come find out about and celebrate 20 years of painting, of urban art, seen, lived and imagined by a artists collective from Brussels, during an Expo\/Event: 20 YEARS OF FARM PROD! An immersive experience within Brussels and (inter)national urban painting scene that will offer to see and live 2 decades of the life of the collective historical members, dedicated to their art, friendship and passion. Highlights will allow anyone to meet and get to know the artists throughout the month during concerts but also workshops and tours, in collaboration with Fais le trottoir asbl, IceScreen collective, Maison des Cultures et de la Coh\u00e9sion Sociale de Molenbeek, and many more.","performers":"Alexis Corrand, Alexandre Alonso, Anthony L\u00e9veque, Arnaud Debal, Cl\u00e9ment Nourry, Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Lebbe, Guillaume Desmarets, Johan Baggio, Nelson Dos Reis et Piotr Szlachta, historic and current members of Farm Prod.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"},"it":{"name":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"},"cn":{"name":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"},"fr":{"name":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":"20 YEARS OF FARM PROD : Une exposition-\u00e9v\u00e8nement sur et \u00e0 l\u2019initiative du collectif de peintres Farm Prod.","longdescr":"Du 1er au 30 septembre 2023, \u00e0 LaVall\u00e9e, (re)d\u00e9couvrez 20 ann\u00e9es de peinture, d'arts urbains, vus, v\u00e9cus et imagin\u00e9s par un collectif d'artistes bruxellois, lors d'une exposition\/\u00e9v\u00e8nement : 20 YEARS OF FARM PROD ! Une exp\u00e9rience immersive au sein de la peinture urbaine bruxelloise et (inter)nationale qui donnera \u00e0 voir et \u00e0 vivre deux d\u00e9cennies de la vie des membres historiques du collectif, pass\u00e9es au nom et service de leur art, amiti\u00e9 et passion. Des moments forts permettront \u00e0 tous.tes de rencontrer et c\u00f4toyer les artistes lors de concerts mais aussi d\u2019ateliers et de visites guid\u00e9es, en collaboration avec Fais le trottoir asbl, le collectif IceScreen, la Maison des Cultures et de la Coh\u00e9sion Sociale de Molenbeek, et bien d\u2019autres.","performers":"Alexis Corrand, Alexandre Alonso, Anthony L\u00e9veque, Arnaud Debal, Cl\u00e9ment Nourry, Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Lebbe, Guillaume Desmarets, Johan Baggio, Nelson Dos Reis et Piotr Szlachta, membres historiques et actuels de Farm Prod.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"},"sp":{"name":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"},"nl":{"name":"20 years of Farm Prod","shortdescr":"20 YEARS OF FARM PROD: en geweldig evenement georganiseerd door kunstenaarscollectief Farm Prod.","longdescr":"Kom naar LaVall\u00e9e van 1 tot 30 september 2023 voor 20 YEARS OF FARM PROD! Een geweldig evenement georganiseerd door kunstenaarscollectief Farm Prod. Ontdek wat onze Brusselse kunstenaars de afgelopen 20 jaar hebben gemaakt op het gebied van schilder- en straatkunst. Geniet van Brusselse en internationale straatkunst en maak kennis met de kunstenaars tijdens concerten, workshops en rondleidingen. Samen met Fais le trottoir asbl, IceScreen, Maison des Cultures et de la Coh\u00e9sion Sociale de Molenbeek en andere partners. Mis deze unieke gebeurtenis niet!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.farmprod.be\/20-years\/","email":"farmprod@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558824"}},"place":{"id":273242,"translations":{"de":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"LaVall\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e","address_street_number":"39","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lavallee.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 491 71 43 65","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Adolphe Lavall\u00e9e, 39","a