er, soprano - Joanna Huszcza, violon - Ira Givol, viole de gambe - Bart Jacobs, orgue, clavecin et direction \r\n\r\nEglise ND de la Chapelle  - 1000 Bruxelles ","performers":"Ensemble C\u00e9ladon - Marta Gliozzi\r\nEnsemble Psallentes - Arnaud Van de Cauter \r\nLes Pastoureaux - Joris Verdin \r\nI quattro Temperamenti - Bart Jacobs ","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=VOCEETORGANO&module=CATALOGUE&lg=FR","website":"http:\/\/www.voceorgano.be","email":"info@voceorgano.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 49 76 59","phone_booking":"+32 487 49 76 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559964"},"sp":{"name":"Festival de musique ancienne Voce et Organo 2023","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.voceorgano.be","email":"info@voceorgano.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 49 76 59","phone_booking":"+32 487 49 76 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559964"},"nl":{"name":"Oude muziek Festival Voce et Organo 2023 : VOX ANGELI","shortdescr":"Voce et Organo Festival 2023: VOX ANGELI.  Prestigieuze gasten, eeuwenoude engelenstemmen (Gregoriaanse Monteverdi Buxtehude Purcell) of romantici (Requiem Faur\u00e9 & kinderkoor).\r\nWij zien u graag tegemoet op 6, 8, 9 en 14 september 2023 in het gouden decor van de OLV ter-Kapellekerk hartje Brussels. Met, als hoogtepunt, het inhuldigingsconcert van het pas gerestaureerde Schijvenorgel!","longdescr":"Woen. 06\/09\/2023 - 20u00 - DULCISSIME JESU\r\nEnsemble C\u00e9ladon olv Paulin Bundgen - Marta Gliozzi, orgel\r\n\r\nVrij. 08\/09\/2023 - 20u00 - VOX ANGELI\r\nEnsemble Psallentes olv Hendrik Vanden Abeele - Arnaud Van de Cauter, orgel\r\n\r\nZat. 09\/09\/2023 - 16u00 - REQUIEM VAN FAURE\r\nEnsemble Les Pastoureaux & Orchestre Acad\u00e9mie des Arts olv Philippe Favette - Joris Verdin, orgel\r\n\r\nDon. 14\/09\/2023 - 20u00 - I QUATTRO TEMPERAMENTI \r\nMichaela Riener, sopraan - Joanna Huszcza, viool - Ira Givol, gamba - Bart Jacobs, orgel klavecimbel en directie\r\n\r\nOLV ter Kapellekerk \u2013 1000 Brussel","performers":"Ensemble C\u00e9ladon - Marta Gliozzi\r\nEnsemble Psallentes - Arnaud Van de Cauter \r\nLes Pastoureaux - Joris Verdin \r\nI quattro Temperamenti - Bart Jacobs ","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=VOCEETORGANO&module=CATALOGUE&lg=NL","website":"http:\/\/www.voceorgano.be","email":"info@voceorgano.be","phone_contact":"+32 487 49 76 59","phone_booking":"+32 487 49 76 59","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559964"}},"place":{"id":479,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kirche Notre-Dame de la Chapelle","address_street_name":"Place de la Chapelle","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Chapelle","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Br\u00fcsseler Notre Dame de la Chapelle-Kirche ist aufgrund ihrer romanischen Architektur bemerkenswert und gilt als eine der interessantesten Kirchen Belgiens.\r\n\r\nIn einer der Kapellen befindet sich das Grabmal des Malers Pieter Breughel und seiner Gemahlin, Marie Coucke. In der Kapelle des Heiligen Sakraments erinnert eine Gedenktafel daran, dass sich hier auch die letzte Ruhest\u00e4tte des zum Tode verurteilten und hingerichteten K\u00f6rperschafts\u00e4ltesten Fran\u00e7ois Anneessens, der sich f\u00fcr die Gemeindefreiheit der Stadt Br\u00fcssel eingesetzt hat, befindet.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame de la Chapelle","address_street_name":"Rue de la Chapelle","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Chapelle","address_line2":"1000 Bruxe