 discover small taverns and mix with locals.\r\nYou will sample beers that are all completely different and all specific to Belgium.\r\nAbbey beers, Trappists, Lambics, Krieks, Belgian IPAs, Triple Blonds, Double Browns... you name it! \r\n\r\nDuring the tour, you will also learn about the city history, discover hidden corners and wander off the beaten path.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022Walking tour of the city center.\r\n\u2022Chocolate tasting tour in the most exclusive chocolate makers of Brussels (minimum 10 chocolates).\r\n\u2022Beer tasting session with overview of Belgian beers styles in bars and a beer shop in the city center (minimum 6 different beers).\r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/hungrymary.com\/","email":"marie@bxljourney.com","phone_contact":"+32 499 25 93 06","phone_booking":"+32 499 25 93 06","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.393621"},"it":{"name":"The Famous Beer and Chocolate Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/hungrymary.com\/","email":"marie@bxljourney.com","phone_contact":"+32 499 25 93 06","phone_booking":"+32 499 25 93 06","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.393621"},"cn":{"name":"The Famous Beer and Chocolate Tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/hungrymary.com\/","email":"marie@bxljourney.com","phone_contact":"+32 499 25 93 06","phone_booking":"+32 499 25 93 06","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.393621"},"fr":{"name":"The Famous Beer and Chocolate Tour","shortdescr":"Nos deux tr\u00e9sors nationaux regroup\u00e9s le temps d'une visite guid\u00e9e!","longdescr":"We will first stop by in various chocolate shops where you will try amazing samples.\r\nCrunchy hazelnut, dark ganache, salted butter caramel, as well as ginger, tea, coffee, saffron or chili... Forget what you already k