r and that Michel Mainil has recounted so well in his book \"Memories of You\" (available during the evening). The moving musical moment that will follow this introduction will feature Jos\u00e9 Bedeur (double bass) in a band that will also include Michel Mainil (Sax) Jean- Denis Tourneur (Guitar) Patrick Wante (Drums) and special guest Philippe Quevauviller (vocals), who is also the editor of Michel Mainil's book \"Memories of You\". Denis Tourneur (Guitar) Patrick Wante (Drums) and, at the end of the evening, special guest Philippe Quevauviller (vocals) who is also the editor of Michel Mainil's book \"Memories of you\".","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/en.bossaflor.com\/events\/jeudi-7-septembre","email":"ederyckel@outlook.fr","phone_contact":"0033672756842","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000452"},"it":{"name":"JAZZ EN FETE - tribute to JOSE BEDEUR","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/en.bossaflor.com\/events\/jeudi-7-septembre","email":"ederyckel@outlook.fr","phone_contact":"0033672756842","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000452"},"cn":{"name":"JAZZ EN FETE - tribute to JOSE BEDEUR","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/en.bossaflor.com\/events\/jeudi-7-septembre","email":"ederyckel@outlook.fr","phone_contact":"0033672756842","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000452"},"fr":{"name":"JAZZ EN FETE - tribute to JOSE BEDEUR","shortdescr":"Pour le contrebassiste Huttois Jose Bedeur ce sont pr\u00e8s de 70 ans de regards, de voyages les plus divers sur le monde \u00e0 travers la musique & le Jazz. A l\u2019occasion de la sorte du livre \u00ab Jos\u00e9 Bedeur : \"Memories of you\" de Michel Mainil aux \u00e9ditions Bossaflor, le Baixu a souhait\u00e9 par une soir\u00e9e concert toute particuli\u00e8re rendre un hommage tout particulier \u00e0 ce grand personnage du Jazz Belge.","longdescr":"A cette occasion nous d\u00e9buterons la soir\u00e9e par une conversation avec Jose Bedeur et Michel Mainil au cours de laquelle vous pourrez d\u00e9couvrir quelques-unes des multiples anecdotes qui ont jalonn\u00e9es le parcours de Jos\u00e9 Bedeur et que Michel Mainil a si bien retrac\u00e9 dans son ouvrage \u00ab m\u00e9moires of you \u00bb (ouvrage disponible au cours de cette soir\u00e9e) L\u2019\u00e9mouvant moment musical qui suivra cette introduction permettra de retrouver Jos\u00e9 Bedeur (contrebasse) au sein d\u2019une formation qui comprendra aussi Michel Mainil (Sax) Jean-Denis Tourneur (Guitare) Patrick Wante (Drums) et en fin de soir\u00e9e en invit\u00e9 sp\u00e9cial Philippe Quevauviller (chant) qui est aussi l\u2019\u00e9diteur du livre \"Memories of you\" de Michel Mainil","performers":"Michel Mainil (Sax) Jean-Denis Tourneur (Guitare) Jos\u00e9 Bedeur (Contrebasse) Patrick Wante (Drums) &amp; guest : Philippe Quevauviller (chant)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/en.bossaflor.com\/events\/jeudi-7-septembre","email":"ederyckel@outlook.fr","phone_contact":"0033672756842","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000452"},"sp":{"name":"JAZZ EN FETE - tribute to JOSE BEDEUR","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/en.bossaflor.com\/events\/jeudi-7-septembre","email":"ederyckel@outlook.fr","phone_contact":"0033672756842","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000452"},"nl":{"name":"JAZZ EN FETE - tribute to JOSE BEDEUR","shortdescr":"Voor Hutt contrabassist Jose Bedeur is het bijna 70 jaar kijken naar de wereld vanuit verschillende perspectieven, de wereld rondreizen door middel van muziek & jazz. Naar aanleiding van de publicatie van het boek \"Jos\u00e9 Bedeur: \"Memories of you\" van Michel Mainil, wilde de Baixu een speciaal hommage brengen aan deze grote figuur van de Belgische jazz met een heel speciaal avondconcert.","longdescr":"De avond begint met een gesprek met Jos\u00e9 Bedeur en Michel Mainil, waarin u kennis kunt maken met enkele van de vele anekdotes die de carri\u00e8re van Jos\u00e9 Bedeur hebben getekend en die Michel Mainil zo goed heeft verteld in zijn boek \"Memories of You\" (verkrijgbaar tijdens de avond). Het ontroerende muzikale moment dat volgt op deze inleiding wordt gevormd door Jos\u00e9 Bedeur (contrabas) in een band waarin ook Michel Mainil (saxofoon) Jean-Denis Tourneur (gitaar) Patrick Wante (drums) en speciale gast Philippe Quevauviller (zang), die ook de redacteur is van Michel Mainils boek \"Memories of You\". Denis Tourneur (gitaar) Patrick Wante (drums) en, aan het eind van de avond, speciale gast Philippe Quevauviller (zang), die ook de redacteur is van Michel Mainils boek \"Memories of you\".","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/en.bossaflor.com\/events\/jeudi-7-septembre","email":"ederyckel@outlook.fr","phone_contact":"0033672756842","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000452"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 47