{"list":[30,24],"translations":{"de":["Malerei","Kunstgalerien"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Painting","Art Galleries"],"it":["Pittura","Gallerie d'arte"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Peinture","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["Pintura","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Schilderkunst","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"pt":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"en":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery is delighted to present 'M\u00eamet\u00e9s', the second solo show with Belgian artist Nathalie Pirotte in its gallery space. Oil painting is key in her oeuvre \u2013 both the desire to paint and to render beauty underpin her artistic practice. ","longdescr":"The exhibition features her recent series of works titled 'M\u00eamet\u00e9s', a French neologism referring to the concept of mimesis and identity. In recent years, Nathalie Pirotte has been focusing on human figuration, mainly creating images of women. In early 2023, she started painting diptychs, in which she doubles her model through mirroring without distortion. The inverted paintings are presented together, forcing us to compare the double paintings by identifying differences and similarities. Through the motif of the double, she explores questions of difference and identity, and provokes thoughts about the painting medium. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"it":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"cn":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"fr":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":"La Husk Gallery est heureuse de pr\u00e9senter \u00ab M\u00eamet\u00e9s \u00bb, la deuxi\u00e8me exposition personnelle de l'artiste belge Nathalie Pirotte au sein de son espace d'exposition. La peinture \u00e0 l'huile est un \u00e9l\u00e9ment cl\u00e9 de son \u0153uvre, le d\u00e9sir de peindre et de restituer la beaut\u00e9 est \u00e0 la base de son travail artistique. ","longdescr":"L'exposition pr\u00e9sente sa r\u00e9cente s\u00e9rie d'\u0153uvres intitul\u00e9e \u00ab M\u00eamet\u00e9s \u00bb, un n\u00e9ologisme fran\u00e7ais qui renvoie au concept de mim\u00easis et d'identit\u00e9. Ces derni\u00e8res ann\u00e9es, Nathalie Pirotte s'est concentr\u00e9e sur la figuration humaine, cr\u00e9ant principalement des images de femmes. Au d\u00e9but de l'ann\u00e9e 2023, elle commence \u00e0 peindre des diptyques, dans lesquels elle double son mod\u00e8le par un jeu de miroir sans distorsion. Les tableaux invers\u00e9s sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s ensemble, ce qui nous oblige \u00e0 comparer les doubles tableaux en identifiant les diff\u00e9rences et les similitudes. \u00c0 travers le motif du double, elle explore les questions de la diff\u00e9rence et de l'identit\u00e9 et suscite la r\u00e9flexion sur le m\u00e9dium peinture. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"sp":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.huskgallery.com","email":"info@huskgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 478 52 16 46","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001026"},"nl":{"name":"Nathalie Pirotte - M\u00eamet\u00e9s","shortdescr":"Husk Gallery presenteert met genoegen \u201cM\u00eamet\u00e9s\u201d, de tweede soloshow met de Belgische kunstenares Nathalie Pirotte (\u00b01965, Albertville) in haar galerieruimte. Olieverfschilderkunst staat centraal in haar oeuvre \u2013 zowel het verlangen om te schilderen als de creatie van schoonheid liggen aan de basis van haar artistieke praktijk.","longdescr":"Op de tentoonstelling is Nathalie Pirottes nieuwste reeks te zien onder de titel \u201cM\u00eamet\u00e9s\u201d, een Frans neologisme dat verwijst naar het concept mimesis en identiteit. De laatste jaren focust Nathalie Pirotte op menselijke figuratie, en in het bijzonder op beelden van vrouwen. Begin 2023 begon ze diptieken te schilderen, waarbij ze haar model via spiegeling verdubbelt zonder vervorming. Door de gespiegelde werken samen te presenteren, dwingen de dubbele schilderijen ons ze te vergelijken en verschillen en gelijkenissen te identificeren. Dankzij het dubbele motief, verkent ze kwesties zoals differentie en identiteit, en stimuleert ze reflecties over het medium schilderkunst. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/w