ull,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"A new spot for art house films, local food and events in the center of Brussels. \r\n\r\nA CINEMA FOR EVERYONE\r\nPalace is intended to cater for everyone, from film buffs to professionals, along with visitors whose occasional trips to the cinema form part of a full programme comprising a dinner and a movie, followed by a drink to round off the evening.\r\nPalace will open its doors to all the communities who breathe life into the centre of the city : the multicultural populations in the southern district, the schoolchildren in the Lower Town and the associative actors who see the cinema as a permanent force for education. And, as its entire infrastructure has been designed to welcome everyone without exception, Palace also invites visitors with limited mobility to experience the magic of the \u201cSeventh Art\u201d, ensuring that they have\r\nunrestricted access.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un nouveau lieu au coeur de Bruxelles alliant films d'auteur, cuisine locale et de saison, et \u00e9v\u00e8nements culturels. \r\n\r\nUN CIN\u00c9MA POUR TOUS. Palace souhaite s\u2019adresser \u00e0 tous les publics, des cin\u00e9philes avertis aux professionnels en passant par ceux qui int\u00e8grent une sortie cin\u00e9ma dans un programme occasionnel complet compos\u00e9 d\u2019un d\u00eener, d\u2019une projection et d\u2019un \u00ab dernier \u00bb verre. \r\nPalace ouvre ses portes \u00e0 tous les publics qui font vivre le centre-ville, qu\u2019il s\u2019agisse de la population multiculturelle des quartiers Sud, des publics scolaires du bas de la ville ou des acteurs associatifs qui consid\u00e8rent le cin\u00e9ma comme une force d\u2019\u00e9ducation permanente. Et parce que son infrastructure a \u00e9t\u00e9 enti\u00e8rement pens\u00e9e pour accueillir tout le monde sans exception, Palace invite \u00e9galement les personnes \u00e0 mobilit\u00e9 r\u00e9duite \u00e0 vivre la magie du Septi\u00e8me Art sans aucune restriction d\u2019acc\u00e8s.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cinema Palace ","address_street_name":"Boulevard Anspach","address_street_number":"85","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.cinema-palace.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Anspach, 85","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Een nieuwe plek voor art house films, lokale gastronomie en evenementen in het centrum van Brussel. \r\n\r\nEEN BIOSCOOP VOOR IEDEREEN\r\nPalace wenst zich uitdrukkelijk te richten tot elk publiek. Zowel de cinefiel, de filmprofessional als zij die op zoek zijn naar een gezellig avondje uit of een leuke familieuitstap, kunnen in Palace terecht voor hun filmbeleving.\r\nIedereen is welkom in Palace. We openen onze deuren voor elk publiek dat het centrum van de stad doet leven, of het nu gaat om de multiculturele bevolking van de wijken in het zuiden, een schoolpubliek uit de laagstad of actoren uit het verenigingsleven die film beschouwen als een bron van educatie en inspiratie. Bovendien is Palace perfect toegankelijk voor mensen met een beperkte mobiliteit.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":30775,"location":{"lat":50.84777637,"lon":4.34870474},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-05-25T12:08:21+02:00","published_at":"2018-02-13T10:01:13+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":257595,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Editions Casterman","address_street_name":"-","address_street_number":"-","address_street_box":"-","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"-","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"-, - \/ -","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Editions Casterman","address_street_name":"-","address_street_number":"-","address_street_box":"-","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"-","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"-, - \/ -","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Editions Casterman","address_street_name":"-","address_street_number":"-","address_street_box":"-","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"-","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"-, - \/ -","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Editions Casterman","address_street_name":"-","address_street_number":"-","address_street_box":"-","email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"-","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"-, - \/ -","address_line2":"1000 B