e":["Kulturerbe"],"pt":[null],"en":["Heritage"],"it":["Patrimonio culturale"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Patrimoine"],"sp":["Patrimonio"],"nl":["Erfgoed"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Roman camp","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"pt":{"name":"Roman camp","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"en":{"name":"Alix turns 75: Roman camp at the BD Comics Strip Festival","shortdescr":"In 2023, Alix celebrates its 75th anniversary.\nAlix celebrates its 75th anniversary in a Roman camp specially created for the Festival, a meeting organised by the Festival with Marc Jailloux: Returning to the classic heroes in 2023 and signing sessions. ","longdescr":"From his first appearance in Le Journal de Tintin on 16 September 1948 to the present day, the young Gallo-Roman has had over 60 adventures in four series (ALIX, ALIX ORIGINES, ALIX SENATOR, LES VOYAGES D'ALIX). More alive than ever, his world is brought to life by authors who combine adventure with great history.","performers":"Alix promises to sign its albums and meet the authors of Alix: Marc Jailloux, Chrys Millien, Olivier Weinberg; dress up and immortalise yourself as a centurion, senator or simple legionnaire... in a Roman setting; meet and chat with the Roman actors on duty in the camp, unless they are marching on the Festival site...\nPlay the Alix board game in giant format ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"it":{"name":"Roman camp","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"cn":{"name":"Roman camp","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"fr":{"name":"Alix f\u00eate ses 75 ans : camp romain au BD Comics Strip Festival","shortdescr":"En 2023, Alix f\u00eate ses 75 ans d\u2019existence.\nAlix f\u00eate ses 75 ans dans un camp romain sp\u00e9cialement cr\u00e9\u00e9 pour le Festival, une rencontre organis\u00e9e par le Festival avec Marc Jailloux : Reprendre les h\u00e9ros classiques en 2023 et des d\u00e9dicaces \n","longdescr":"Depuis sa premi\u00e8re apparition dans Le Journal de Tintin le 16 septembre 1948 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 aujourd\u2019hui, le jeune gallo-romain a connu plus de 60 aventures qui se d\u00e9clinent d\u00e9sormais en quatre s\u00e9ries  (ALIX, ALIX ORIGINES, ALIX SENATOR, LES VOYAGES D\u2019ALIX). Plus vivant que jamais, son univers est anim\u00e9 par des auteurs qui m\u00ealent le souffle de l\u2019aventure \u00e0 la grande Histoire.","performers":"Alix promet de d\u00e9dicacer ses albums et rencontrer les auteurs d\u2019Alix : Marc Jailloux, Chrys Millien, Olivier Weinberg  ; se d\u00e9guiser et s\u2019immortaliser  en centurion, s\u00e9nateur ou simple l\u00e9gionnaire\u2026 dans un d\u00e9cor romain ; rencontrer et \u00e9changer avec les acteurs romains en faction dans le camp \u00e0 moins qu\u2019ils ne d\u00e9filent sur le site du Festival\nJouer au jeu de table Alix en format g\u00e9ant ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"sp":{"name":"Roman camp","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"},"nl":{"name":"Alix wordt 75: Romeins kamp op het BD Stripfestival","shortdescr":"In 2023 viert Alix zijn 75e verjaardag.\nAlix viert zijn 75e verjaardag met een Romeins kamp dat speciaal voor het Festival is gemaakt, een bijeenkomst georganiseerd door het Festival met Marc Jailloux: Terugkeer naar de klassieke helden in 2023 en signeersessies. ","longdescr":"Vanaf zijn eerste verschijning in Le Journal de Tintin op 16 september 1948 tot nu heeft de jonge Gallo-Roman meer dan 60 avonturen beleefd in vier series (ALIX, ALIX ORIGINES, ALIX SENATOR, LES VOYAGES D'ALIX). Levendiger dan ooit wordt zijn wereld tot leven gebracht door auteurs die avontuur combineren met grootse geschiedenis.","performers":"Alix belooft zijn albums te signeren en de auteurs van Alix te ontmoeten: Marc Jailloux, Chrys Millien, Olivier Weinberg; verkleed je en vereeuwig jezelf als centurio, senator of eenvoudige legionair... in een Romeins decor; ontmoet en praat met de Romeinse acteurs die dienst doen in het kamp, tenzij ze marcheren op het Festivalterrein...\nSpeel het Alix bordspel in reuzenformaat ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001458"}},"place":{"id":279735,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Food Market- Gare Maritime- Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard ","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":null,"email":"bojohnson@spacefungame.com","website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard , 9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Food Market- Gare Maritime- Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Ru