ungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"},"en":{"name":"Gauthier Hubert - \"je dois vous dire que Tarzan n\u2019a pas \u00e9crit Le Livre de la jungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.\"","shortdescr":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub gallery is pleased to announce the next solo show of the Belgian artist: Gauthier Hubert This second solo exhibition presents a new serie of fascinating characters in immersive colours. Gauthier Hubert's paintings, combining a strangeness of form with perfect technique, create a mixed feeling of seduction and discomfort.","longdescr":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub gallery is pleased to announce the next solo show of the Belgian artist: Gauthier Hubert This second solo exhibition presents a new serie of fascinating characters in immersive colours. Gauthier Hubert's paintings, combining a strangeness of form with perfect technique, create a mixed feeling of seduction and discomfort. Gauthier Hubert was born in 1967 in Brussels (BE). He won the 1999 \u00ab Prix de la jeune peinture belge \u00bb and has since shown his work in international group and solo shows, mostly in the UK, Iceland and Belgium. Language is essential in Gauthier Hubert\u2019s works; the title frames the pictorial subject or precedes it, in a constant back and forth between text and image. The title is a primary element of the work and creates a constant back and forth between word and image. Situated in a satirical dialogue with art and history, Gauthier Hubert\u2019s paintings are extremely referenced, interspersing their composition with clues, jokes and visual puns. The treatment and choice of subject often lead to a deeper examination of the pictorial discipline \u2013 for Gauthier Hubert, painting is a pretext to talk about painting.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"},"it":{"name":"je dois vous dire que Tarzan n\u2019a pas \u00e9crit Le Livre de la jungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"},"cn":{"name":"je dois vous dire que Tarzan n\u2019a pas \u00e9crit Le Livre de la jungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"},"fr":{"name":"Gauthier Hubert - \"je dois vous dire que Tarzan n\u2019a pas \u00e9crit Le Livre de la jungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.\"","shortdescr":"La galerie Ir\u00e8ne Laub a le plaisir d'annoncer la prochaine exposition personnelle de l'artiste belge : Gauthier Hubert. Cette seconde exposition personnelle pr\u00e9sente une nouvelle s\u00e9rie de personnages fascinants aux couleurs immersives. Les peintures de Gauthier Hubert, alliant une \u00e9tranget\u00e9 des formes et une technique parfaite, nous plonge un sentiment m\u00eal\u00e9 de s\u00e9duction et d\u2019inconfort.","longdescr":"La galerie Ir\u00e8ne Laub a le plaisir d'annoncer la prochaine exposition personnelle de l'artiste belge : Gauthier Hubert. Cette seconde exposition personnelle pr\u00e9sente une nouvelle s\u00e9rie de personnages fascinants aux couleurs immersives. Les peintures de Gauthier Hubert, alliant une \u00e9tranget\u00e9 des formes et une technique parfaite, nous plonge un sentiment m\u00eal\u00e9 de s\u00e9duction et d\u2019inconfort. Gauthier Hubert est n\u00e9 en 1967 \u00e0 Bruxelles (BE). Il a remport\u00e9 le \"Prix de la jeune peinture belge\" en 1999 et a depuis pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 son travail dans des expositions collectives et individuelles internationales, principalement au Royaume-Uni, en Islande et en Belgique. Le langage est essentiel dans les \u0153uvres de Gauthier Hubert ; le titre encadre le sujet pictural ou le pr\u00e9c\u00e8de, dans un va-et-vient constant entre le texte et l'image. Le titre est un \u00e9l\u00e9ment primordial de l'\u0153uvre et cr\u00e9e un va-et-vient constant entre le mot et l'image. Situ\u00e9es dans un dialogue satirique avec l'art et l'histoire, les peintures de Gauthier Hubert sont extr\u00eamement r\u00e9f\u00e9renc\u00e9es, parsemant leur composition d'indices, de blagues et de jeux de mots visuels. Le traitement et le choix du sujet conduisent souvent \u00e0 un examen plus approfondi de la discipline picturale - pour Gauthier Hubert, la peinture est un pr\u00e9texte pour parler de la peinture.","performers":"Gauthier Hubert (peintre)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"},"sp":{"name":"je dois vous dire que Tarzan n\u2019a pas \u00e9crit Le Livre de la jungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"},"nl":{"name":"Gauthier Hubert - \"je dois vous dire que Tarzan n\u2019a pas \u00e9crit Le Livre de la jungle et Mowgli n\u2019a pas couch\u00e9 avec Jane.\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/irenelaubgallery.com\/","email":"info@irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000187"}},"place":{"id":248003,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery ","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery ","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Since 2016, Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery exhibits established and emerging artists in Brussels and in a selection of international art fairs. Our represented artists are actively committed to questioning social, political and architectural spaces. They present a very diverse body of work \u2013 inculding installation, video, sculpture, painting and drawing \u2013 and display pure and powerful aesthetics. The gallery is intended as an adaptable experimentation space, allowing the artists to stretch the boundaries of their chosen discipline, either by testing and distorting the physical frame of the work itself, or by exploring its significance in the social sphere.\r\nIn 2018, the gallery moved to a new location and developed an ambitious exhibition programme, dedicated to further a productive dialogue between international artists, curators and institutions.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"LAUB","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery ","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery ","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 647 55 16","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Eyck, 29","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Ir\u00e8ne Laub Gallery ","address_street_name":"Rue Van Eyck","address_street_number":"29","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@irenelaubgallery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.irenelaubgallery.com","phone_contact":