00","timestamp":"2023-09-07T18:30:00"}},{"id":50001011,"date_start":"2023-09-08","date_end":"2023-10-21","date_next":"2023-09-08","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-08-16T11:45:01+02:00","published_at":"2023-08-16T11:31:18+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":283309,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.2832581674713524,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[26,24],"translations":{"de":["Skulptur","Kunstgalerien"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Sculpture","Art Galleries"],"it":["Scultura","Gallerie d'arte"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Sculpture","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["Escultura","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Beeldhouwkunst","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"pt":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"en":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":" \nThe art of Skender Hyseni seems the oldest in the world as it is tormented by the questions \nof time. The notches, the scratches are stigmas that testify the founding gesture of man on \nthe raw and imperfect material.","longdescr":"The art of Skender Hyseni seems the oldest in the world as it is tormented by the questions \nof time. The notches, the scratches are stigmas that testify the founding gesture of man on \nthe raw and imperfect material. By the action of his hand, his fingers, his entire body, he \nbreathes spirit into matter which streches and wraps around itself forming in its lair, places \nhidden from the light of where a fascinating mystery emanates. The sculptor willingly \nintegrates his work into the space that involves both light and its opposite, when the \nshadow is as solid as the projected object. As he dialogues with the most modest of \nsubstances: earth,this humble texture is transfigured by the poetry of the artist into a \nminimalist sculptural form, both rustic but so refined at the same time that it becomes \nsumptuous. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"it":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"cn":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"fr":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":"L\u2019art de Skender Hyseni para\u00eet le plus ancien du monde tant il est pr\u00e9occup\u00e9 par le\nrespect de la chose originelle et tourment\u00e9 par les questionnements du temps. Il est\nnaturel pour l\u2019artiste albanais d\u2019exiger le tout d\u2019une vie. Les entailles, les d\u00e9chirures sont\nautant de stigmates qui t\u00e9moignent du geste fondateur de l\u2019homme sur la mati\u00e8re brute\net imparfaite. ","longdescr":"L\u2019art de Skender Hyseni para\u00eet le plus ancien du monde tant il est pr\u00e9occup\u00e9 par le\nrespect de la chose originelle et tourment\u00e9 par les questionnements du temps. Il est\nnaturel pour l\u2019artiste albanais d\u2019exiger le tout d\u2019une vie. Les entailles, les d\u00e9chirures sont\nautant de stigmates qui t\u00e9moignent du geste fondateur de l\u2019homme sur la mati\u00e8re brute\net imparfaite. Par l\u2019action de sa main, de ses doigts, de son corps tout entier, il insuffle\nl\u2019esprit \u00e0 la mati\u00e8re qui s\u2019\u00e9tire et s\u2019enroule sur elle-m\u00eame formant dans son antre, des\nlieux soustraits \u00e0 la lumi\u00e8re d\u2019o\u00f9 \u00e9mane un fascinant myst\u00e8re. Le sculpteur int\u00e8gre\nvolontiers son \u0153uvre dans l\u2019espace qui implique \u00e0 la fois la lumi\u00e8re et son contraire,\nquand l\u2019ombre y est aussi solide que l\u2019objet projet\u00e9. Alors qu\u2019il dialogue avec la plus\nmodeste des substances : la terre, cette humble texture se voit transfigur\u00e9e par la po\u00e9sie\nde l\u2019artiste en une forme sculpturale minimaliste, \u00e0 la fois rustique mais si raffin\u00e9e qu\u2019elle\nen devient somptueuse. ","performers":"SKENDER HYSENI","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"sp":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"},"nl":{"name":"SKENDER HYSENI","shortdescr":"De kunst van Skender Hyseni is een ode aan de oorspronkelijkheid van alles en de \nin vraagstelling van de tijdelijkheid. De inkepingen en schaafwonden getuigen van \nde menselijke invloed op de ruwe en onvolmaakte materie. ","longdescr":"De kunst van Skender Hyseni is een ode aan de oorspronkelijkheid van alles en de \nin vraagstelling van de tijdelijkheid. De inkepingen en schaafwonden getuigen van \nde menselijke invloed op de ruwe en onvolmaakte materie. Zijn handen, vingers en \nlichaam geven geest aan de materie die zich uitstrekt en om zich heen wikkelt in \nhaar eigen intieme verbogen plaatsen, die een fascinerend mysterie brengt.\nDe beeldhouwer uit Albani\u00eb, integreert graag zijn werk in de ruimte die zowel licht \nals de tegenhanger ervan illustreert, wanneer de schaduw haar aanwezigheid even \nsterk vestigt als het geprojecteerde object. \nTerwijl hij dialogeert met de meest bescheiden substantie: de aarde, wordt deze \nnederige textuur door de po\u00ebzie van de kunstenaar getransfigureerd in een \nminimalistische sculpturale vorm die zowel rustiek maar toch zo verfijnd wordt, dat \nde weelderigheid zich manifesteert. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.zedes-art-gallery.be","email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 646 00 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001011"}},"place":{"id":50000371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Zedes Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Rue Paul Lauters","address_street_number":"36","address_street_box":null,"email":"zedes.art.gallery@gmail.com