mita | Visit and workshop for children (in FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"},"en":{"name":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita | Visit and workshop for children (in FR)","shortdescr":"To mark the release of their book \"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita\", authors Lisbeth Renardy and Thomas Medard have put together a drawing workshop inspired by their book. The workshop is preceded by a visit to the exhibition, punctuated by excerpts from the story, featuring a gallery of characters with truculent collections.\n(in FRENCH!)","longdescr":"What does it mean to collect? What can be collected? And who collects what? Do you collect? What does that say about you? What does it say about you? And the museum, the museum has a collection, a collection of what?\n\nTo mark the release of their book \"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita\", authors Lisbeth Renardy and Thomas Medard have put together a drawing workshop inspired by their book. The workshop is preceded by a visit to the exhibition, punctuated by excerpts from the story, featuring a gallery of characters with truculent collections.\n\nin FRENCH | Activity for children aged 5 to 10 | 3\u20ac per child | book here: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-4pkw | Signing session after the workshop. \"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita\" is published by Les Fourmis Rouges.\n\n","performers":"The authors of the book, Lisbeth Renardy and Thomas Medard","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"},"it":{"name":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita | Visit and workshop for children (in FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"},"cn":{"name":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita | Visit and workshop for children (in FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"},"fr":{"name":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita | Visite et atelier pour enfants","shortdescr":"\u00c0 l\u2019occasion de la sortie de leur livre \u00ab L\u2019\u00e9trange collection de Mamita \u00bb, les auteurs Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas Medard ont concoct\u00e9 un atelier de dessin inspir\u00e9 de leur ouvrage. L\u2019atelier est pr\u00e9c\u00e9d\u00e9 d\u2019une visite de l\u2019exposition ponctu\u00e9e d\u2019extraits de ce r\u00e9cit mettant en sc\u00e8ne une galerie de personnages aux collections truculentes.","longdescr":"Collectionner \u00e7a veut dire quoi ? Qu\u2019est-ce qui se collectionne ? Et qui collectionne quoi ? Et toi, tu collectionnes ? Et \u00e7a dit quoi de toi ? Hein ? Et le mus\u00e9e, le mus\u00e9e il a une collection, une collection de quoi ?\n\n\u00c0 l\u2019occasion de la sortie de leur livre \u00ab L\u2019\u00e9trange collection de Mamita \u00bb, les auteurs Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas Medard ont concoct\u00e9 un atelier de dessin inspir\u00e9 de leur ouvrage. L\u2019atelier est pr\u00e9c\u00e9d\u00e9 d\u2019une visite de l\u2019exposition ponctu\u00e9e d\u2019extraits de ce r\u00e9cit mettant en sc\u00e8ne une galerie de personnages aux collections truculentes.\n\nActivit\u00e9 pour enfants de 5 \u00e0 10 ans | 3\u20ac par enfant | r\u00e9server ici : https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-4pkw | S\u00e9ance de d\u00e9dicace \u00e0 l\u2019issue de l\u2019atelier. \u00ab L\u2019\u00e9trange collection de Mamita \u00bb est paru aux \u00e9ditions Les Fourmis Rouges.","performers":"les auteurs du livre, Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas Medard","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"},"sp":{"name":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita | Visit and workshop for children (in FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"},"nl":{"name":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita | Bezoek en workshop voor kinderen (in het FR)","shortdescr":"Ter gelegenheid van het verschijnen van hun boek \"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita\" hebben auteurs Lisbeth Renardy en Thomas Medard een tekenworkshop samengesteld, ge\u00efnspireerd op hun boek. De workshop wordt voorafgegaan door een rondleiding door de tentoonstelling met uittreksels uit het boek en een galerij van personages met kleurrijke verzamelingen.\n(in het FRANS!)","longdescr":"Wat betekent verzamelen? Wat kan er verzameld worden? En wie verzamelt wat? Verzamel jij? En wat zegt dat over jou? Wat zegt het over jou? En het museum, het museum heeft een verzameling, een verzameling van wat?\n\nTer gelegenheid van het verschijnen van hun boek \"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita\" hebben auteurs Lisbeth Renardy en Thomas Medard een tekenworkshop samengesteld, ge\u00efnspireerd op hun boek. De workshop wordt voorafgegaan door een rondleiding door de tentoonstelling met uittreksels uit het boek en een galerij van personages met kleurrijke verzamelingen.\n\nin het FRANS | Activiteit voor kinderen van 5 tot 10 jaar | \u20ac3 per kind | boek hier: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-4pkw | Handtekeningensessie na de workshop. \"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita\" is uitgegeven door Les Fourmis Rouges.","performers":"De auteurs van het boek, Lisbeth Renardy en Thomas Medard","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000799"}},"place":{"id":738,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Art brut - Outsider Art - Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst\r\n\r\nDas Museum Art et Marges zeigt eine Sammlung, die seit den 1980er-Jahren kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst. Dabei handelt es sich um Kunst abseits des Mainstreams, die einen Blick auf die autodidaktischen K\u00fcnslter wirft, Kunstateliers f\u00fcr Menschen mit geistiger Behinderung oder in Psychiatrien. \r\nIn den Ausstellungen mischen sich K\u00fcnstler diesseits und jenseits der Grenze des \"Au\u00dfenseitertums\" (engl. Begriff \"Art Outsider\"), die die Kunst und deren Beschr\u00e4nkungen hinterfragt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Museum of outsider art. Since its founding in 1984 and the first exhibition of 1986, Art & Marge \u2013 now the \u2018art )&( marges [margins] museum\u2019 \u2013 promotes artists outside the mainstream. These self-taught artists, often called \u201coutsider artists\u201d, work either individually or in creative workshops in institutions for people who are mentally unwell or who are mentally challenged. In addition to the permanent collection,  temporary exhibitions will establish a dynamic dialogue with paintings by professional artists from the mainstream who are active in their cultural surroundings \u2013 the boundary between \u2018insider\u2019 and \u2018outsider\u2019 art?   The \u2018Art & Marges\u2019 museum is not a ghetto museum but a venue for exchange, where individuality is of prime importance and where all efforts are made to make all target groups feel at home.\r\n\r\nOpen Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays between 11.00 am and 5.30 pm by appointment only.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e, mus\u00e9e d\u2019art brut - contemporain - outsider art, questionne l\u2019art et ses fronti\u00e8res. Sa collection s\u2019est constitu\u00e9e d\u00e8s le milieu des ann\u00e9es 80 aupr\u00e8s d\u2019artistes autodidactes, d\u2019ateliers artistiques pour personnes porteuses d\u2019un handicap mental ou d\u2019ateliers en milieu psychiatrique. Elle se compose aujourd\u2019hui de plus de 4000 \u0153uvres internationales produites en dehors des sentiers fr\u00e9quent\u00e9s de l\u2019art. Ses expositions temporaires, au rythme de deux \u00e0 trois par an, m\u00ealent artistes de part et d\u2019autre de la marge et questionnent l\u2019art et sa d\u00e9finition-m\u00eame. ","description_print":"Mus\u00e9e d'art outsider","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Art)&(Marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Desde su creaci\u00f3n, el Centro de Investigaci\u00f3n y Difusi\u00f3n del arte outsider Art en Marge (que se convirti\u00f3 posteriormente en el museo Art)&Marges) aboga por los artistas que no forman parte del circuito cultural oficial. Los conocidos actualmente como \u00aboutsiders\u00bb (ver glosario) son creadores autodidactas que trabajan solos o en talleres creativos para personas psicol\u00f3gicamente vulnerables o con alguna discapacidad mental. Algunos son internos de residencias para discapacitados mentales, hospitales psiqui\u00e1tricos, y otros son trabajadores o extrabajadores de una amplia gama de profesiones: fot\u00f3grafos, anticuarios, zapateros, m\u00fasicos...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Hoogstraat","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Hoogstraat, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Outsiderkunst museum. Sinds zijn oprichting in 1984 en de eerste tentoonstelling in 1986, verdedigt de vzw Art en Marge - het huidige art )&( marges museum - kunstenaars die uit de boot van het offici\u00eble culturele circuit vallen. Die autodidactische kunstenaars worden \u201coutsiders\u201d genoemd en werken alleen of in creatieve workshops voor zieke of gehandicapte personen. Naast de permanente verzameling, zorgen tijdelijke tentoonstellingen voor een dynamische dialoog met de werken van professionele kunstenaars die actief zijn in het offici\u00eble culturele milieu, om de grenzen van de in- en outsiderkunst af te tasten. art )&( marges museum is geen ghettomuseum maar een plaats van uitwisseling, een ruimte waarin de individualiteit hoogtij viert en waarin alles in het werk gesteld wordt om ervoor te zorgen dat alle doelgroepen zich thuis voelen.\r\n\r\nOpen op vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag tussen 11.00 en 17.30 uur, alleen op afspraak.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Marollen"],"pt":[null],"en":["Marolles"],"it":["Marolles"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Marolles"],"sp":["Marolles"],"nl":["Marollen"]}},"zones":{"list":[21,19],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden","Zentrum"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["South","Centre"],"it":["Sud","Centro"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Sud","Centre"],"sp":["Sur","Centro"],"nl":["Zuid","Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":149,"location":{"lat":50.83472811,"lon":4.3463823},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-06-04T15:50:58+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":738,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Art brut - Outsider Art - Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst\r\n\r\nDas Museum Art et Marges zeigt eine Sammlung, die seit den 1980er-Jahren kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst. Dabei handelt es sich um Kunst abseits des Mainstreams, die einen Blick auf die autodidaktischen K\u00fcnslter wirft, Kunstateliers f\u00fcr Menschen mit geistiger Behinderung oder in Psychiatrien. \r\nIn den Ausstellungen mischen sich K\u00fcnstler diesseits und jenseits der Grenze des \"Au\u00dfenseitertums\" (engl. Begriff \"Art Outsider\"), die die Kunst und deren Beschr\u00e4nkungen hinterfragt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Museum of outsider art. Since its founding in 1984 and the first exhibition of 1986, Art & Marge \u2013 now the \u2018art )&( marges [margins] museum\u2019 \u2013 promotes artists outside the mainstream. These self-taught artists, often called \u201coutsider artists\u201d, work either individually or in creative workshops in institutions for people who are mentally unwell or who are mentally challenged. In addition to the permanent collection,  temporary exhibitions will establish a dynamic dialogue with paintings by professional artists from the mainstream who are active in their cultural surroundings \u2013 the boundary between \u2018insider\u2019 and \u2018outsider\u2019 art?   The \u2018Art & Marges\u2019 museum is not a ghetto museum but a venue for exchange, where individuality is of prime importance and where all efforts are made to make all target groups feel at home.\r\n\r\nOpen Fridays, Saturdays and Sundays between 11.00 am and 5.30 pm by appointment only.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e, mus\u00e9e d\u2019art brut - contemporain - outsider art, questionne l\u2019art et ses fronti\u00e8res. Sa collection s\u2019est constitu\u00e9e d\u00e8s le milieu des ann\u00e9es 80 aupr\u00e8s d\u2019artistes autodidactes, d\u2019ateliers artistiques pour personnes porteuses d\u2019un handicap mental ou d\u2019ateliers en milieu psychiatrique. Elle se compose aujourd\u2019hui de plus de 4000 \u0153uvres internationales produites en dehors des sentiers fr\u00e9quent\u00e9s de l\u2019art. Ses expositions temporaires, au rythme de deux \u00e0 trois par an, m\u00ealent artistes de part et d\u2019autre de la marge et questionnent l\u2019art et sa d\u00e9finition-m\u00eame. ","description_print":"Mus\u00e9e d'art outsider","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Art)&(Marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Desde su creaci\u00f3n, el Centro de Investigaci\u00f3n y Difusi\u00f3n del arte outsider Art en Marge (que se convirti\u00f3 posteriormente en el museo Art)&Marges) aboga por los artistas que no forman parte del circuito cultural oficial. Los conocidos actualmente como \u00aboutsiders\u00bb (ver glosario) son creadores autodidactas que trabajan solos o en talleres creativos para personas psicol\u00f3gicamente vulnerables o con alguna discapacidad mental. Algunos son internos de residencias para discapacitados mentales, hospitales psiqui\u00e1tricos, y otros son trabajadores o extrabajadores de una amplia gama de profesiones: fot\u00f3grafos, anticuarios, zapateros, m\u00fasicos...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Hoogstraat","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Hoogstraat, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Outsiderkunst museum. Sinds zijn oprichting in 1984 en de eerste tentoonstelling in 1986, verdedigt de vzw Art en Marge - het huidige art )&( marges museum - kunstenaars die uit de boot van het offici\u00eble culturele circuit vallen. Die autodidactische kunstenaars worden \u201coutsiders\u201d genoemd en werken alleen of in creatieve workshops voor zieke of gehandicapte personen. Naast de permanente verzameling, zorgen tijdelijke tentoonstellingen voor een dynamische dialoog met de werken van professionele kunstenaars die actief zijn in het offici\u00eble culturele milieu, om de grenzen van de in- en outsiderkunst af te tasten. art )&( marges museum is geen ghettomuseum maar een plaats van uitwisseling, een ruimte waarin de individualiteit hoogtij viert en waarin alles in het werk gesteld wordt om ervoor te zorgen dat alle doelgroepen zich thuis voelen.\r\n\r\nOpen op vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag tussen 11.00 en 17.30 uur, alleen op afspraak.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":149,"location":{"lat":50.83472811,"lon":4.3463823},"last_updated_at":"2023-06-04T15:50:58+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/cb0533200dbfda3f4127929fe76325130ff03c6e.jpg","width":2048,"height":1350,"ratio":1,"oEmbed_height":1350,"oEmbed_width":2048,"translations":{"de":{"title":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita","copyright":"Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas M\u00e9dard, Les fourmis rouges"},"pt":{"title":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita","copyright":"Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas M\u00e9dard, Les fourmis rouges"},"en":{"title":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita","copyright":"Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas M\u00e9dard, Les fourmis rouges"},"it":{"title":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita","copyright":"Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas M\u00e9dard, Les fourmis rouges"},"cn":{"title":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita","copyright":"Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas M\u00e9dard, Les fourmis rouges"},"fr":{"title":"L'\u00e9trange collection de Mamita","copyright":"Lisbeth Renardy et Thomas M\u00e9dard, Les f