3 99","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 2-4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das BIP ist die erste Anlaufstelle f\u00fcr Touristen und jeden, der sich \u00fcber Br\u00fcssel informieren m\u00f6chte, denn der Komplex ist gewisserma\u00dfen das Schaufenster der Hauptstadtregion Br\u00fcssel. Neben einem Informationsschalter mit pers\u00f6nlichem Empfang finden Sie hier auch Brosch\u00fcren ein Internet-Terminal etc.\r\n\r\nSonder\u00f6ffnungszeiten: 24.12. und 31.12.: von 9 bis 15 Uhr\r\n\r\nDas ganze Jahr \u00fcber organisiert das BIP Ausstellungen und andere Veranstaltungen in der Stadt. Besuchen Sie die interaktive Ausstellung \u201eExperience Brussels\" und erhalten Sie einen faszinierenden Einblick in die vielf\u00e4ltigen Facetten der Stadt Br\u00fcssel.\r\n\r\nEinige S\u00e4le des BIP k\u00f6nnen angemietet werden, hier tagt auch die Br\u00fcsseler Regierung.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Bip - Maison de la R\u00e9gion","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"2-4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@vsit.brussels","website":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/sites\/bipforrent\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 63 99","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 2-4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bip - House of the Capital Region","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"2-4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@vsit.brussels","website":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/sites\/bipforrent\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 63 99","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 2-4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"This centre, in the heart of the Mont des Arts\/Kunstberg, is an essential tool for those who want to get to know Brussels (better). It informs tourists and everybody else looking for information about entertainment, cultural life, highlights and the places to be. It's a tourist information desk, an internet terminal, a tour departure point, a lounge, ...  Throughout the year the Bip organises temporary exhibitions, shows, events and animations. You can (re)discover Brussels in a new light as you explore the breath-taking interactive and free exhibition \u201cExperience Brussels\u201d. Take in the sights, the sounds and the feel of Brussels in all its rich diversity!\r\nA wide variety of meeting rooms can be rented, and it is also the seat of The Government of the Brussels-Capital Region.\r\n\r\nExceptional openings: 24\/12 & 31\/12: 9 am till 3 pm\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bip - Maison de la R\u00e9gion","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"2-4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@vsit.brussels","website":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/sites\/bipforrent\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 63 99","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 2-4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Bip - Maison de la R\u00e9gion","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"2-4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@vsit.brussels","website":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/sites\/bipforrent\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 63 99","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 2-4","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Bip - Maison de la R\u00e9gion","address_street_name":