tion:\r\nPrice:\r\nAdults: 50\u20ac\r\nChildren (from 4 to 11 years old): 30 \u20ac\r\nChildren (under 4 years old): Free.\r\n\r\nWhen:\r\nEvery Saturday.\r\n\r\nStarting time:\r\n3pm\r\n\r\nMeeting point:\r\nGrand-Place in front of the City Hall. Find our guides! They hold a white umbrella.\r\n\r\nDuration:\r\n2,5 hours.\r\n\r\nLanguage:\r\nEnglish.\r\n\r\nIncluded:\r\nProfessional guides (English-speaking).\r\nTasting of +\/- 10 special chocolates.\r\n\r\nNot included:\r\nAdditional tastings or drinks. \r\n\r\n\r\n ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 32 03 62","phone_booking":"32 0470 60 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.383200"},"it":{"name":"Circuit de d\u00e9gustation de chocolats \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 32 03 62","phone_booking":"32 0470 60 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.383200"},"cn":{"name":"Circuit de d\u00e9gustation de chocolats \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 32 03 62","phone_booking":"32 0470 60 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.383200"},"fr":{"name":"Circuit de d\u00e9gustation de chocolats \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":"D\u00e9gustez les meilleurs chocolats chez\u00a0les chocolatiers les plus renomm\u00e9s de Bruxelles\u00a0et d\u00e9couvrez la tradition du chocolat belge dans notre\u00a0circuit de d\u00e9gustation de chocolats \u00e0 Bruxelles. \r\n\r\n","longdescr":"Programme :\r\n\r\nLeonidas.\r\nGaller.\r\nCorn\u00e9e Port Royal.\r\nMary.\r\nNeuhaus.\r\nLaurent Gerbaud.\r\nPierre Marcolini.\r\nGodiva.\r\nMaison Dandoy.\r\n*Le programme peut \u00eatre l\u00e9g\u00e8rement modifi\u00e9 en fonction de la disponibilit\u00e9 de diff\u00e9rentes chocolateries.\r\n\r\n\r\nPrix :\r\nAdultes :\u00a050\u20ac\r\nJeunes (de 4 \u00e0 11 ans) :\u00a030\u20ac\r\nEnfants (moins de 4 ans) :\u00a0Gratuit.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQuand :\r\nTous les samedis.\r\n\r\n\r\nHeures de d\u00e9part :\r\n15h\r\n\r\n\r\nPoint de rencontre :\r\nLa Grand-Place de Bruxelles, en face de l\u2019H\u00f4tel de ville. Vous reconna\u00eetrez nos guides gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 leur\u00a0parapluie blanc\u00a0muni du logo Bravo Discovery.\r\n\r\n\r\nDur\u00e9e :\r\n2h30\r\n\r\n\r\nLangue :\r\nFran\u00e7ais, \r\n\r\n\r\nInclus :\r\nGuide passionn\u00e9 et professionnel.\r\nD\u00e9gustation de chocolats et de pralines.\r\n\r\n\r\nNon inclus :\r\nConsommations suppl\u00e9mentaires.\r\n \r\n\r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 32 03 62","phone_booking":"32 0470 60 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.383200"},"sp":{"name":"Circuit de d\u00e9gustation de chocolats \u00e0 Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 32 03 62","phone_booking":"32 0470 60 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.383200"},"nl":{"name":"Belgian Chocolate Tasting Tour - Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 495 32 03 62","phone_booking":"32 0470 60 35 05","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.383200"}},"place":{"id":256791,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Duplex Paul-Amaury Michel","address_street_name"