scr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"pt":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"en":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"it":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"cn":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"fr":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Bon alors, c\u2019est l\u2019histoire d\u2019un canard qui\u2026 Mais non, pas du tout, y a pas de canard ! C\u2019est l\u2019histoire tragique de la femme tromp\u00e9e par son mari cocu qui voudrait bien r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer sa femme d\u00e9laiss\u00e9e sur le point de le quitter pour partir en Italie avec son amant...\r\n\r\nOh l\u00e0 l\u00e0 c\u2019est tragique cette histoire de canard ?\r\n\r\nMeuh non, y a pas de canard. C\u2019est l\u00e9ger, c\u2019est doucement dingue. \u00c7a casse pas trois pattes \u00e0 un canard, mais c\u2019est d\u00e9sopilant.\r\n\r\nMesdames, Messieurs, voici une \u00e9pastrouillante com\u00e9die gaie, qui \u00e0 sa mani\u00e8re nous replonge dans les ann\u00e9es \u201970. Le temps des chefs de famille et des femmes au foyer. Ce temps \u00ab b\u00e9ni \u00bb du monde d\u2019avant #Metoo, un vrai boulevard quoi. N\u2019h\u00e9sitez pas, prenez place, laissez faire\u2026 c\u2019est vintage ! Coin, coin.\r\n__________\r\n\r\nDe Douglas William Home \/ Adaptation : Marc-Gilbert Sauvageon \/ Mise en sc\u00e8ne : Nicolas Brian\u00e7on \/ Avec : Charlie Dupont et Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Nyssen (en alternance), Tania Garbarski, Laure Godisiabois, Michel Kacenelenbogen et Marina Pangos\r\n__________\r\n\r\nUNE PRODUCTION DU TH\u00c9\u00c2TRE LE PUBLIC. AVEC LE SOUTIEN DU TAX SHELTER DE L\u2019\u00c9TAT F\u00c9D\u00c9RAL BELGE VIA BESIDE ET DE LA COMMUNAUT\u00c9 FRAN\u00c7AISE. LA PI\u00c8CE \u00abTHE SECRETARY BIRD\u00bb DE WILLIAM DOUGLAS HOME EST REPR\u00c9SENT\u00c9E DANS LES PAYS EUROP\u00c9ENS DE LANGUE FRAN\u00c7AISE PAR L\u2019AGENCE DRAMA \u2013 SUZANNE SARQUIER WWW.DRAMAPARIS.COM EN ACCORD AVEC JANET GLASS \u00c0 LONDRES.\r\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"sp":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrelepublic.be","email":"contact@theatrelepublic.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 44","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558094"},"nl":{"name":"Le canard \u00e0 l'orange","s