estimate the power of planting a seed\nStory seeds give birth to talkative flowers. Their stories are full of witty characters, humour and grimaces. Tales of animals, clever or not... that will delight young and old alike.\nLess moralizing, more fun to tell than a fable, animal tales are a first step into the world of stories.","longdescr":null,"performers":"St\u00e9phanie Witta","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001485"},"it":{"name":"Conte pour enfants - Animaux Finauds","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001485"},"cn":{"name":"Conte pour enfants - Animaux Finauds","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001485"},"fr":{"name":"Conte pour enfants - Animaux Finauds","shortdescr":"Les graines de conte donnent naissance \u00e0 des fleurs bavardes. Leurs histoires abondent de personnages truculents, d'humour et de grimaces. Des contes d\u2019animaux fut\u00e9s ou pas... qui raviront les petites et grandes oreilles.\nMoins moralisateurs, plus ludiques \u00e0 raconter qu'une fable, les contes d'animaux sont un premier pas dans l'univers des histoires.","longdescr":null,"performers":"St\u00e9phanie Witta","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001485"},"sp":{"name":"Conte pour enfants - Animaux Finauds","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001485"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderverhaal - Ambachtelijke dieren. Vanaf 4 jaar","shortdescr":"Onderschat nooit de kracht van het planten van een zaadje\nUit verhaalzaadjes ontstaan spraakzame bloemen. Hun verhalen zitten vol kleurrijke personages, humor en grimassen. Verhalen over dieren, slim of niet... die jong en oud in verrukking zullen brengen.\nMinder moraliserend, leuker om te vertellen dan een fabel, zijn dierenverhalen een eerste stap in de wereld van verhalen.","longdescr":null,"performers":"St\u00e9phanie Witta","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001485"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un lieu atypique et chaleureux dans le quartier de Tour & Taxis \u00e0 Bruxelles pour assister \u00e0 des concerts, des expositions, des projections ou des conf\u00e9rences, ou pour y organiser vos \u00e9v\u00e8nements priv\u00e9s.\r\nUn projet d\u00e9di\u00e9 au \u00ab beau \u00bb sous toutes ses coutures, dont les maitres-mots sont qualit\u00e9, \u00e9changes et rencontres.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Picardstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"De naam \"Baixu\" betekent \"mooi\" in de taal van de Pataxos indianen die in de zuidelijke staat Bahia (Brazili\u00eb) wonen. Dit woord staat voor de ambitie van het project en de kwaliteit van de culturele evenementen, maar ook voor de verbondenheid van de initiatiefnemers met de Braziliaanse cultuur. \r\nLe Baixu is ondergebracht in een voormalig industrieel gebouw in het hart van de trendy Brusselse Tour & Taxis wijk. Een atypische en warme plek bedoeld voor concerten, tentoonstellingen, filmvertoningen en conferenties en waar je ook priv\u00e9 evenementen kan organiseren. Het is een volledig uitgeruste, multidisciplinaire culturele ruimte met een oppervlakte van 150 m2, gewijd aan de \"schoonheid\" in al haar vormen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":39109,"location":{"lat":50.86391031,"lon":4.34697026},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-05-11T08:22:15+02:00","published_at":"2022-07-15T20:19:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","addre