ne_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560979"},"en":{"name":"Moortebeek : une cit\u00e9-jardin \u00e0 Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560979"},"it":{"name":"Moortebeek : une cit\u00e9-jardin \u00e0 Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560979"},"cn":{"name":"Moortebeek : une cit\u00e9-jardin \u00e0 Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560979"},"fr":{"name":"Moortebeek : une cit\u00e9-jardin \u00e0 Anderlecht","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Aux confins d\u2019Anderlecht, la cit\u00e9 de Moortebeek est construite, \u00e0 partir de 1923, \u00e0 l\u2019initiative de la premi\u00e8re coop\u00e9rative de locataires bruxelloise, les Foyers Collectifs. Sept architectes diff\u00e9rents y ont exerc\u00e9 leur talent parmi lesquels Fernand Brunfaut et Joseph Diongre.\r\n\r\nEn r\u00e9sulte une grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 architecturale d\u2019o\u00f9 se d\u00e9gage pourtant une certaine unit\u00e9, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019harmonisation des couleurs et des mat\u00e9riaux utilis\u00e9s. \u00c0 ce titre, Moortebeek constitue un exemple tr\u00e8s abouti de cit\u00e9-jardin, comparable aux cit\u00e9s Le Logis et Flor\u00e9al \u00e0 Boitsfort. La pr\u00e9servation de ces caract\u00e9ristiques donne \u00e0 l\u2019ensemble beaucoup de charme.","perfo