null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"pt":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"en":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":"A show with legends from the L.A. Underground Hip-Hop : Blu & Exile and M.E.D (Stones Throw)\nWarm Up & Afterparty : Fatoosan (Suplafly, BE)\n","longdescr":"\/\/BLU & EXILE\/\/\n\nBlu & Exile is an American hip-hop band from Los Angeles, composed by the rapper Blu and the producer Exile.\n\nThey first met in the mid-2000s while Blu was serving as a hype man for various hip-hop groups including Slum Village, Platinum Pied Pipers, and Exile and Aloe Blacc\u2019s group, Emanon and while Exile was earning production credits for the likes of Jurassic 5, Kardinal Offishall, and Mobb Deep.\n\nIn 2007, Blu & Exile released their debut album, Below the Heavens, by Sound In Color, described by XXL Mag as \u00ab one of 2007\u2019s most celebrated hip-hop releases \u00bb.\n\nThe dynamic duo is then signed by Dirty Science and released many records as so the album Miles : From An Interlude Called Life in 2019 features from platinum recording artist Miguel, Aloe Blacc, Fashawn, along with several emerging artists like The Last, Artful Dodger, Choosey, Iman Omari, and more\n\n\/\/M.E.D aka Medaphoar\/\/\n\nM.E.D. is an American rapper from Oxnard, California, formerly known as Medaphoar.\n\nAfter being featured on Lootpack's 1999 album Soundpieces: Da Antidote, he has been signed to Stones Throw Records.\n\nHe was featured on Quasimoto's The Unseen (2000) and Madlib's Shades of Blue (2003) and released his debut album in 2005, Push Comes to Shove, produced by Madlib, Oh No, J Dilla, and Just Blaze.\n\nOther records will follow, produced by Madlib, Oh No, The Alchemist, Georgia Anne Muldrow, Karriem Riggins, with fearturing by Aloe Blacc, Talib Kweli, Hodgy Beats et Planet Asia.\n\nHe then joined Bang Ya Head and released some collaborative records with J. Rocc on Theme Music (2014), Blu and Madlib on Bad Neighbor (2015) or Guilty Simpson, Black Milk, Waajeed and Exile (Loyalty, 2019) \n\n\/\/FATOOSAN (Supafly)\/\/\n\nFatoosan is one of the founders of the first Belgian female hip hop crew SUPAFLY COLLECTIVE, active between 2009 and 2022.\n\nWith her crew or in solo, Fatoosan played at Belgian and European renowned events such as the World Wide Festival, Couleur Caf\u00e9, Les Ardentes and Dour.\n\nInfluenced by various genres, Fatoosan will take you on a journey that can balance the bass of rap or future beats with broken beat, soul or Afro-Latin rhythms from the 60s-70s\n\n\/\/LINKS\/\/\n\nBlu & Exile\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4w\n\u25ba Instagram : \nBlu : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3P\nExile : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3x\n\u25ba Facebook : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4E\n\nBad Neighbor (M.E.D. & Blu)\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4R\n\u25ba Instagram : \nBlu : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3P\nM.E.D. : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5b \n\nFatooSan\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5C\n\u25ba Instagram : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3n \n\u25ba Facebook : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5t\n","performers":"MC Blu (b. Johnson Barnes) \nDJ\/Producer Exile (b. Aleksander Manfredi)\nMC M.E.D aka Medaphoar (Nick Rodriguez)\nDJ\/Producer Fatoosan (Fatoo San)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"it":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"cn":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"fr":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":"Un show avec des l\u00e9gendes du Hip-Hip Underground de L.A. : Blu & Exile et M.E.D (Stones Throw)\nWarm Up & Afterparty : Fatoosan (Suplafly, BE)\n","longdescr":"\/\/BLU & EXILE\/\/\n\nBlu & Exile est un groupe de hip-hop am\u00e9ricain de Los Angeles compos\u00e9 du rappeur Blu et du producteur Exile.\n\nIls se sont rencontr\u00e9s pour la premi\u00e8re fois au milieu des ann\u00e9es 2000. Blu jouait le r\u00f4le d\u2019animateur pour divers groupes de hip-hop, dont Slum Village, Platinum Pied Pipers et le groupe d\u2019Exile et d\u2019Aloe Blacc, Emanon, et Exile produisait pour Jurassic 5, Kardinal Offishall et Mobb Deep, entre autres.\n\nEn 2007, Blu & Exile sortent leur premier album, Below the Heavens chez Sound In Color, d\u00e9crit par XXL Mag comme \u00ab l\u2019un des albums hip-hop les plus importants de 2007 \u00bb.\n\nLe duo dynamique int\u00e8gre ensuite le label Dirty Science et sortent plusieurs disques dont l\u2019album Miles : From An Interlude Called Life en 2019 avec des featuring de l'artiste platine Miguel, Aloe Blacc, Fashawn, ainsi que plusieurs artistes \u00e9mergents comme The Last, Artful Dodger, Choosey, Iman Omari, et bien d'autres.\n\n\/\/M.E.D aka Medaphoar\/\/\n\nM.E.D., est un rappeur am\u00e9ricain d'Oxnard, en Californie, autrefois connu sous le nom de Medaphoar.\n\nApr\u00e8s avoir figur\u00e9 sur l'album Soundpieces: Da Antidote de Lootpack en 1999, il signe chez Stones Throw Records.\n\nIl appara\u00eet dans des featurings sur les albums The Unseen de Quasimoto (2000) et Shades of Blue de Madlib (2003) et sort son premier album en 2005, Push Comes to Shove, produit par Madlib, Oh No, J Dilla et Just Blaze.\n\nSuivront plusieurs autres disques produits par Madlib, Oh No, The Alchemist, Georgia Anne Muldrow, Karriem Riggins, avec des featurings d\u2019Aloe Blacc, Talib Kweli, Hodgy Beats et Planet Asia.\n\nIl int\u00e8gre ensuite le label Bang Ya Head et sort plusieurs albums collaboratifs avec J. Rocc (Theme Music, 2014), Blu et Madlib (Bad Neighbor, 2015), ou encore avec Guilty Simpson, Black Milk, Waajeed et Exile (Loyalty, 2019).\n\n\/\/FATOOSAN (Supafly)\/\/\n\nFatoosan est l'une des fondatrices du premier crew hip-hop f\u00e9minin belge SUPAFLY COLLECTIVE, actif entre 2009 et 2022.\n\nAvec son crew ou en solo, Fatoosan a jou\u00e9 dans des \u00e9v\u00e9nements belges et europ\u00e9ens tels que le World Wide Festival, Couleur Caf\u00e9, Les Ardentes et Dour. \n\nInfluenc\u00e9e par diff\u00e9rents genres, Fatoosan vous emm\u00e8nera dans un voyage qui peut \u00e9quilibrer les basses du rap, ou les future beats, avec des broken beat, de la soul ou des rythmes afro-latins des ann\u00e9es 60-70.\n\n\n\/\/LINKS\/\/\n\nBlu & Exile\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4w\n\u25ba Instagram : \nBlu : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3P\nExile : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3x\n\u25ba Facebook : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4E\n\nBad Neighbor (M.E.D. & Blu)\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4R\n\u25ba Instagram : \nBlu : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3P\nM.E.D. : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5b \n\nFatooSan\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5C\n\u25ba Instagram : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3n \n\u25ba Facebook : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5t","performers":"MC Blu (b. Johnson Barnes) \nDJ\/Producteur Exile (b. Aleksander Manfredi)\nMC M.E.D aka Medaphoar (Nick Rodriguez)\nDJ\/Producteur Fatoosan (Fatoo San)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"sp":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"},"nl":{"name":"Blu & Exile + M.E.D + Fatoosan","shortdescr":"Een show met legendes uit de L.A. Underground Hip-Hop : Blu & Exile en M.E.D (Stones Throw)\nWarm Up & Afterparty : Fatoosan (Suplafly, BE)","longdescr":"\/\/BLU & EXILE\/\/\n\nBlu & Exile is een hiphopgroep uit Los Angeles, samengesteld uit de rapper Blu en de producer Exile.\n\nZe ontmoetten elkaar voor het eerst in het midden van de jaren 2000. Toen Blu werkte als emcee voor verschillende hiphopgroepen, waaronder Slum Village, Platinum Pied Pipers en Exile and Aloe Blacc\u2019s groep, Emanon, en  Exile verdiende producties voor onder andere Jurassic 5, Kardinal Offishall en Mobb Deep.\n\nIn 2007 brachten Blu & Exile hun debuutalbum Below the Heavens uit bij Sound In Color, omgeschreven door XXL Mag als \"een van de belangrijkste hiphopalbums van 2007\".\n\nHet dynamische duo sloot zich vervolgens aan bij het label Dirty Science en bracht verschillende records uit, zoals het album Miles : From An Interlude Called Life in 2019 met featurings van platina artiest Miguel, Aloe Blacc, Fashawn, samen met verschillende opkomende artiesten zoals The Last, Artful Dodger, Choosey, Iman Omari, en nog veel meer.\n\n\/\/M.E.D aka Medaphoar\/\/\n\nM.E.D. is een Amerikaanse rapper uit Oxnard, Californi\u00eb, voorheen bekend als Medaphoar.\n\nNadat hij in 1999 verscheen op Lootpack's album Soundpieces: Da Antidote, tekende hij bij Stones Throw Records.\n\nHij verscheen in featurings op Quasimoto's The Unseen (2000) en Madlib's Shades of Blue (2003), en in 2005 bracht hij zijn eerste album Push Comes to Shove uit, geproduceerd door Madlib, Oh No, J Dilla en Just Blaze.\n\nAndere records zullen geproduceerd worden door Madlib, Oh No, The Alchemist, Georgia Anne Muldrow, Karriem Riggins, met bijdragen van Aloe Blacc, Talib Kweli, Hodgy Beats en Planet Asia.\n\nMet Bang Ya Head bracht hij vervolgens gezamenlijke albums uit, met J. Rocc (Theme Music ,2014), Blu en Madlib (Bad Neighbor, 2015) als ook Guilty Simpson, Black Milk, Waajeed en Exile (Loyalty,2019).\n\n\/\/FATOOSAN (Supafly)\/\/\n\nFatoosan is een van de oprichtsters van de eerste vrouwelijke hiphopcrew van Belgi\u00eb, SUPAFLY COLLECTIVE, actief tussen 2009 en 2022.\n\nMet haar crew of alleen, speelde Fatoosan op Belgische en Europese gerenommeerde evenementen zoals het World Wide Festival, Couleur Caf\u00e9, Les Ardentes en Dour.\n\nBe\u00efnvloed door verschillende genres, neemt Fatoosan je mee op een reis die de bas van rap of future beats kan balanceren met broken beat, soul of Afro-Latijnse ritmes uit de jaren 60-70.\n\n\/\/LINKS\/\/\n\nBlu & Exile\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4w\n\u25ba Instagram : \nBlu : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3P\nExile : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3x\n\u25ba Facebook : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4E\n\nBad Neighbor (M.E.D. & Blu)\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ4R\n\u25ba Instagram : \nBlu : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3P\nM.E.D. : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5b \n\nFatooSan\n\u25ba YouTube : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5C\n\u25ba Instagram : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ3n \n\u25ba Facebook : http:\/\/bitly.ws\/RJ5t\n","performers":"MC Blu (b. Johnson Barnes) \nDJ\/Producer Exile (b. Aleksander Manfredi)\nMC M.E.D aka Medaphoar (Nick Rodriguez)\nDJ\/Producer Fatoosan (Fatoo San)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/melodiggerz.be\/","email":"info@melodiggerz.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001164"}},"place":{"id":50000402,"translations":{"de":{"name":"BXL Central 