{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"de":"Animationen","pt":null,"en":"Animations","it":"Animazioni","cn":null,"fr":"Animations","sp":"Animaciones","nl":"Animaties"}},"others":{"list":[99],"translations":{"de":["Gastronomie"],"pt":[null],"en":["Gastronomy"],"it":["Cucina"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Gastronomie"],"sp":["Gastronom\u00eda"],"nl":["Gastronomie"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Wine tasting: when the Burgundians were also from Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"pt":{"name":"Wine tasting: when the Burgundians were also from Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"en":{"name":"Wine tasting: when the Burgundians were also from Brussels","shortdescr":"Dive into the cellars of the former Palace of the Dukes of Burgundy in Brussels and stimulate your senses.","longdescr":"Unfortunately, this tasting has been\u00a0fully booked. Would you like to stay informed about future tastings? Subscribe to our newsletter (http:\/\/eepurl.com\/hNIRhH).\n\nXavier H\u00e9rail, tasting instructor, invites you to discover the grape varieties of the past and present; those that have shaped our taste since the 15th century and the influence of the Burgundian dynasty, up to the current trends and the work of the winegrowers\/assemblers of our regions. An experience to be lived and tasted in the very heart of the remains of the Coudenberg Palace, where heritage, history and archaeology will be combined with wine-making traditions and the evolution of consumption patterns. Within the framework of the Brussels Renaissance Festival, with the support of visit.brussels. Practical information: Dates: Friday, 15th Septembre from 7 p.m. to 9.30 p.m \u2013 doors open from p.m. to 6.30 p.m. Price: 40\u20ac - The price includes: access to the Coudenberg Palace and wine tasting (6 to 8 wines from our regions) Entrance: Place Royale 10 Koningsplein \u2013 1000 Brussels Info: www.coudenberg.brussels or + 32 (0)2 563 61 79 Reservation compulsory: info@coudenberg.brussels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"http:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/en\/50000172\/wine-tasting-when-the-burgundians-were-also-from-brussels\/shop","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"it":{"name":"Wine tasting: when the Burgundians were also from Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"cn":{"name":"Wine tasting: when the Burgundians were also from Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"fr":{"name":"D\u00e9gustation de vin : quand les Bourguignons \u00e9taient aussi Bruxellois","shortdescr":"Plongez dans les caves de l\u2019ancien palais des ducs de Bourgogne, \u00e0 Bruxelles, et \u00e9veillez vos sens\u2026","longdescr":"Malheureusement cette d\u00e9gustation est compl\u00e8te. Vous souhaitez rester au courant de nouvelles dates ? Abonnez-vous \u00e0 notre newsletter\u00a0(http:\/\/eepurl.com\/hNIRhH). \n\nXavier H\u00e9rail, formateur \u00e0 la d\u00e9gustation, vous invite \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les c\u00e9pages d\u2019hier et d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui ; ceux qui ont fa\u00e7onn\u00e9 notre go\u00fbt depuis le 15e si\u00e8cle et l\u2019influence de la dynastie bourguignonne, jusqu\u2019aux tendances actuelles et le travail des viticulteurs \/assembleurs de nos r\u00e9gions. Une exp\u00e9rience \u00e0 vivre et \u00e0 d\u00e9guster au c\u0153ur m\u00eame des vestiges du Palais du Coudenberg o\u00f9 se m\u00ealeront patrimoine, histoire et arch\u00e9ologie avec pour fil rouge les traditions viticoles et l\u2019\u00e9volution des modes de consommation. Informations pratiques : Dates : vendredi 15 septembre de 19h00 \u00e0 21h30 \u2013 ouverture des portes \u00e0 18h30. Prix : 40\u20ac - Le prix comprend : l\u2019acc\u00e8s au Palais du Coudenberg et la d\u00e9gustation (6 \u00e0 8 vins de nos r\u00e9gions) Entr\u00e9e : Place Royale 10 \u2013 1000 Bruxelles Infos : www.coudenberg.brussels ou + 32 (0)2 563 61 79 R\u00e9servation obligatoire : info@coudenberg.brussels L\u2019activit\u00e9 se d\u00e9roulera en fran\u00e7ais","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"http:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/fr\/50000172\/degustation-de-vin-quand-les-bourguignons-etaient-aussi-bruxellois\/shop","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"sp":{"name":"Wine tasting: when the Burgundians were also from Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"},"nl":{"name":"Wijndegustatie : toen de Bourgondi\u00ebrs ook Brusselaars waren","shortdescr":"Duik onder in de kelders van het voormalige paleis van de hertogen van Bourgondi\u00eb te Brussel en prikkel al je zintuigen\u2026","longdescr":"Deze degustatie is helaas volzet. Blijf je graag op de hoogte van de volgende degustatie? Schrijf je dan in op onze nieuwsbrief (http:\/\/eepurl.com\/hNIRhH).\n\nXavier H\u00e9rail, degustatiebegeleider, nodigt je uit om de druivensoorten uit heden en verleden te ontdekken; van degenen die onze smaak hebben gevormd sinds de 15e eeuw en de invloed van de Bourgondische dynastie, tot de hedendaagse tendensen en het werk van wijnbouwers en blenders in onze streken. Een ervaring om te beleven en te proeven in het hart van de overblijfselen van het Coudenbergpaleis waar erfgoed, geschiedenis en archeologie vermengd worden met als rode draad de wijnbouwtradities en de evolutie van de manier van consumeren. Praktische informatie: Datum: vrijdag 15 september van 19u00 tot 21u30 \u2013 deuren openen om 18u30. Prijs: \u20ac40 \u2013 inbegrepen: toegang tot het Coudenbergpaleis en degustatie (6 tot 8 wijnen uit onze regio) Ingang: Koningsplein 10 \u2013 1000 Brussel Info: www.coudenberg.brussels of +32 (0)2 563 61 79 Reservering verplicht: info@coudenberg.brussels De activiteit gaat door in het Frans.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":"http:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/nl\/50000172\/wijndegustatie-toen-de-bourgondiers-ook-brusselaars-waren\/shop","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 563 61 79","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000172"}},"place":{"id":258195,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio ","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los <b>vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg<\/b>, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una <b>exposici\u00f3n permanente<\/b> de objetos hallados durante las distintas <b>excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas<\/b> realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"de":["K\u00f6nigliches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Royal"],"it":["Quartiere reale"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"sp":["Quartier Royal \u2014Barrio de la Corte\u2014"],"nl":["Koninklijke wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":18195,"location":{"lat":50.84261029,"lon":4.36068879},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-08-14T16:36:49+02:00","published_at":"2014-05-05T10:58:29+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":258195,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 50