:{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"pt":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"en":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"it":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"cn":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"fr":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":"Un hymne \u00e0 la vie - \"Oui, \u00e0 60 ans on peut encore \u00eatre belle et d\u00e9sirante\"\r\n\r\nLa vie, ce sont des cycles. Tu nais l\u2019enfant de tes parents. Tu deviens la m\u00e8re de tes enfants. Apr\u00e8s, la m\u00e8re de tes parents. Puis, l\u2019enfant de tes enfants. Et tu meurs.","longdescr":"Marie, 64 ans, est nez pour une grande marque de parfum. \u00c0 quelques mois de prendre sa pension, sa bo\u00eete lui demande de r\u00e9aliser un dernier parfum qui s'adresse aux femmes de son \u00e2ge. En m\u00eame temps, elle s\u2019occupe de sa m\u00e8re atteinte de la maladie d\u2019Alzheimer. \u00c0 travers tout le r\u00e9cit, Marie se regarde vieillir, cartographie son corps qui se ride. Elle a renonc\u00e9 \u00e0 la sensualit\u00e9, se persuadant qu\u2019elle n\u2019a plus l\u2019\u00e2ge de vivre l\u2019amour.\r\n\r\nJusqu\u2019au jour o\u00f9\u2026\r\n\r\nApr\u00e8s \u00abLa Solitude du mammouth\u00bb et \u00abQuand tu es revenu\u00bb, Genevi\u00e8ve Damas explore avec finesse et douceur le rapport au d\u00e9sir d\u2019une femme apr\u00e8s 60 ans. Il s\u2019agit d\u2019aborder le temps qui passe comme n\u2019\u00e9tant pas seulement une fatalit\u00e9 douloureuse qui s\u2019inscrit sur la peau et fatigue le corps, mais comme une p\u00e9riode de la vie qui ouvre un champ des possibles.\r\n\r\nUn texte jouissif et jubilatoire \u00e9crit sur mesure pour H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Theunissen.","performers":"De: Genevi\u00e8ve Damas\r\nMise en sc\u00e8ne: Lara Ceulemans\r\nAvec: H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Theunissen (Mari) et Gaspard Audouin (cadreur)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"sp":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 724 24 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.556032"},"nl":{"name":"Perfect Day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bruxellons.be","email":"info@bruxellons.net","phone_contact":"+32 2 724 24 24","phone_booking