\/event-detail.50001189"},"en":{"name":"A dialogue between painting and music, Bernard Foccroulle","shortdescr":"Bernard Foccroulle has devised a programme that brings together ancient and contemporary works with paintings by Fabienne Verdier. Each of her paintings will be set against a counterpoint from J.S. Bach's Art of the Fugue.","longdescr":"This programme will be performed by Bernard Foccroulle on his harpsichord built by Jean-Luc Wolfs-Dachy, based on the harpsichord by Johannes Ruckers (1624) in the Mus\u00e9e Unterlinden in Colmar. Fabienne Verdier has created an exceptional set of four paintings for this new instrument, paving the way for new encounters between painting and music.\n","performers":" Bernard Foccroulle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001189"},"it":{"name":"A dialogue between painting and music, Bernard Foccroulle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001189"},"cn":{"name":"A dialogue between painting and music, Bernard Foccroulle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001189"},"fr":{"name":"Un dialogue entre peinture et musique,  Bernard Foccroulle","shortdescr":"Bernard Foccroulle a con\u00e7u un programme qui met en r\u00e9sonance des oeuvres anciennes et contemporaines avec les peintures de Fabienne Verdier. Chacun de ses tableaux sera confront\u00e9 \u00e0 un Contrepoint extrait de l\u2019Art de la Fugue de J.S. Bach.","longdescr":"Ce programme sera interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 par Bernard Foccroulle sur son clavecin construit par Jean-Luc Wolfs-Dachy, d\u2019apr\u00e8s le clavecin de Johannes Ruckers (1624) conserv\u00e9 au Mus\u00e9e Unterlinden \u00e0 Colmar. Fabienne Verdier a r\u00e9alis\u00e9 pour ce nouvel instrument un ensemble exceptionnel de quatre peintures, ouvrant ainsi la voie \u00e0 de nouvelles rencontres entre peinture et musique.","performers":" Bernard Foccroulle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001189"},"sp":{"name":"A dialogue between painting and music, Bernard Foccroulle","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001189"},"nl":{"name":"Een dialoog tussen schilderkunst en muziek, Bernard Foccroulle","shortdescr":"Bernard Foccroulle heeft een programma samengesteld dat oude en hedendaagse werken samenbrengt met schilderijen van Fabienne Verdier. Elk van haar schilderijen wordt geplaatst tegen een contrapunt uit de Kunst van de Fuga van J.S. Bach.","longdescr":"Dit programma wordt uitgevoerd door Bernard Foccroulle op zijn klavecimbel gebouwd door Jean-Luc Wolfs-Dachy, gebaseerd op het klavecimbel van Johannes Ruckers (1624) in het Mus\u00e9e Unterlinden in Colmar. Fabienne Verdier heeft een uitzonderlijke set van vier schilderijen gemaakt voor dit nieuwe instrument, waarmee ze de weg vrijmaakt voor nieuwe ontmoetingen tussen schilderkunst en muziek.","performers":" Bernard Foccroulle","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001189"}},"place":{"id":279109,"