be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 279 43 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555528"},"it":{"name":"Fashion walk : Diane von Furstenberg. Woman Before Fashion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.museemodeetdentelle.brussels","email":"musea@brucity.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 279 43 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555528"},"cn":{"name":"Fashion walk : Diane von Furstenberg. Woman Before Fashion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.museemodeetdentelle.brussels","email":"musea@brucity.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 279 43 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555528"},"fr":{"name":"Fashion walk : Diane von Furstenberg. Woman Before Fashion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Linda Van Waesberge vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des boutiques tendance du haut de la ville. D\u00e9couvrez la mode belge en passant notamment par la boutique bruxelloise de Diane Von Furstenberg. Un essayage de l\u2019embl\u00e9matique robe portefeuille vous est propos\u00e9.\n\nInformations pratiques:\n\n- Pour les individuels\n- A 11h\n- Dur\u00e9e : 1h30\n- D\u00e9part : devant le magasin Pierre Marcolini, Rue des Minimes 1\n- Tarif : 10 \u20ac (max. 15 personnes)\n- La r\u00e9servation est obligatoire via notre site web","performers":"Linda Van Waesberge vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des boutiques tendance du haut de la ville. ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.museemodeetdentelle.brussels","email":"musea@brucity.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 279 43 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555528"},"sp":{"name":"Fashion walk : Diane von Furstenberg. Woman Before Fashion","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":nu