a\/event-detail.559158"},"en":{"name":"Cassandra Festival","shortdescr":"A new season opens with a new opera. Come and celebrate with us the world premiere of Cassandra during a week-long festival in and around La Monnaie. You will be able to enjoy a wide range of multidisciplinary events for all ages \u2026","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be\/en\/static-pages\/2854-programme","email":"events@lamonnaie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 66 77","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559158"},"it":{"name":"Cassandra Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be\/fr\/static-pages\/2854-programme","email":"events@lamonnaie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 66 77","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559158"},"cn":{"name":"Cassandra Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be\/fr\/static-pages\/2854-programme","email":"events@lamonnaie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 66 77","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559158"},"fr":{"name":"Cassandra Festival","shortdescr":"C\u00e9l\u00e9brons la premi\u00e8re mondiale de Cassandra avec un festival multidisciplinaire \u00e0 la Monnaie et dans ses alentours. Pendant une semaine, laissez-vous surprendre par un large \u00e9ventail d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements tous publics !","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be\/fr\/static-pages\/2854-programme","email":"events@lamonnaie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 66 77","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559158"},"sp":{"name":"Cassandra Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be\/fr\/static-pages\/2854-programme","email":"events@lamonnaie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 66 77","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559158"},"nl":{"name":"Cassandra Festival","shortdescr":"Een nieuw seizoen, geopend met een nieuwe opera \u2013 dat vieren we met een multidisciplinair festival in en rond de Munt. Laat je een hele week lang verrassen door een brede waaier aan evenementen op maat van elke leeftijd!","longdescr":"Een nieuw seizoen, geopend met een nieuwe opera \u2013 dat vieren we met een multidisciplinair festival in en rond de Munt. Laat je een hele week lang verrassen door een brede waaier aan evenementen op maat van elke leeftijd!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be\/nl\/static-pages\/2854-programma","email":"events@lamonnaie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 555 66 77","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559158"}},"place":{"id":1724,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Br\u00fcsseler Staatsoper \u201eLa Monnaie\" z\u00e4hlt zu den sch\u00f6nsten Theatern und renommiertesten Opernh\u00e4usern Europas und bietet ein hochkar\u00e4tiges internationales Repertoire zwischen Oper, Tanz und Konzerten.\r\n\r\nEin eigenes Symphonieorchester, eine Chor und eine Truppe, die mit Leidenschaft bei der Sache ist, und ein internationales Repertoire zwischen Tradition und Avantgarde sind das Erfolgsgeheimnis von La Monnaie. Begegnungen mit K\u00fcnstlern, Schriftstellern und Intellektuellen erg\u00e4nzen das Programm.\r\n\r\nDer 1695 an der Stelle der M\u00fcnzpr\u00e4geanstalt erbaute Prachtbau der Br\u00fcsseler Oper wurde nach einem Brand im Jahre 1885 von dem belgischen Architekten J. Poelaert, aus dessen Feder auch der Br\u00fcsseler Justizpalast stammt, wieder aufgebaut. \r\n\r\nWem nicht das Gl\u00fcck verg\u00f6nnt ist, einer der Vorstellungen beizuwohnen, der kann das Geb\u00e4ude auch einfach besichtigen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Monnaie is the federal operahouse of Belgium, residing in the European capital  with an international reputation for producing opera\u2019s, dance, concerts and recitals. Beside housing an own orchestra, choir and in-house ateliers, they can proudly rely on a passionate and dynamic team of coworkers and volunteers.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Monnaie est la maison d\u2019op\u00e9ra f\u00e9d\u00e9rale situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de la capitale de l\u2019Europe qui produit et propose une programmation de renomm\u00e9e internationale d'op\u00e9ra, danse, concerts et r\u00e9citals. \u2028La Monnaie dispose d\u2019un orchestre symphonique, un ch\u0153ur, des ateliers et une \u00e9quipe artistique passionn\u00e9e qui aident la maison \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser chaque saison une programmation vari\u00e9e et innovatrice, traversant  les limites de genre, p\u00e9riode et culture. En plus, la Monnaie vous propose des rencontres avec des artistes, des \u00e9crivains et des intellectuels, qui vous invitent \u00e0 \u00e9largir vos horizons.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"La Monnaie","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lamonnaie.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"De Munt","address_street_name":"Munt","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@demunt.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lamonnaiedemunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 229 12 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 229 12 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Munt","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"De Munt is het federale operahuis in de hoofdstad van Europa dat internationaal gerenommeerde operaproducties, dansvoorstellingen, concerten en recitals produceert en presenteert. De Munt beschikt over een eigen symfonieorkest, een koor, eigen ateliers en een gepassioneerde artistieke ploeg, waarmee het operahuis ijvert om elk seizoen weer een gevarieerd en vooruitstrevend programma te kunnen realiseren dat over de grenzen van genres, periodes en culturele verschillen heen durft te kijken. Bovendien organiseert de Munt ontmoetingen met kunstenaars, schrijvers en intellectuelen, die u uitnodigen om nieuwe paden te verkennen en uw horizon te verbreden.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":208,"location":{"lat":50.84996484,"lon":4.35348679},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+