Rue de Flandre, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Bellone is mainly a place dedicated to research and reflection, in other words a dramaturgy tool, for stage artists.\r\nLa Bellone wants to be:\r\nA platform for meetings and exchanges;\r\nA place where the work of research and reflection led by the stage artists is meaningful for all;\r\nA place capable of reinventing its proposals to the artistic community at any moment in order to create the most favorable conditions to present their approaches and reflections to the public;\r\nA place that connects to the work of stage artists of the French community of Belgium but which is open to artists of all origins;\r\nA place that considers artistic knowledge as a valuable and necessary social knowledge.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison du Spectacle - la Bellone","address_street_name":"Rue de Flandre","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"infos@bellone.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bellone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 33 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Flandre, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Maison du Spectacle - la Bellone","address_street_name":"Rue de Flandre","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"infos@bellone.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bellone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 33 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Flandre, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Maison du Spectacle - la Bellone","address_street_name":"Rue de Flandre","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"infos@bellone.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bellone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 33 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Flandre, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Bellone, Maison du Spectacle, est vou\u00e9e aux arts de la sc\u00e8ne (th\u00e9\u00e2tre, danse, op\u00e9ra, cirque, performance\u2026) et se situe au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles. Le centre n\u00e9vralgique de ses activit\u00e9s est une cour couverte d\u2019un toit de verre, abritant une fa\u00e7ade baroque, construite \u00e0 l\u2019aube du XVIIIe si\u00e8cle par Jean Cosyn, architecte-sculpteur de la Grand-Place. Forum des arts de la sc\u00e8ne, vitrine destin\u00e9e \u00e0 les mettre en valeur, et lieu de m\u00e9moire vivante, La Bellone propose des services permanents, notamment \u00e0 travers son centre de ressources sur le th\u00e9\u00e2tre, et organise des manifestations, moments de rencontres privil\u00e9gi\u00e9es avec les artistes. La maison abrite plusieurs associations li\u00e9es au spectacle vivant : la Biblioth\u00e8que des Arts du Spectacle de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise, Contredanse, les Midis de la Po\u00e9sie, le R\u00e9seau des Arts \u00e0 Bruxelles et la Biblioth\u00e8que de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration nationale des Compagnies dramatiques (FNCD)","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Maison du Spectacle - la Bellone","address_street_name":"Rue de Flandre","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"infos@bellone.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bellone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 33 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Flandre, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Maison du Spectacle - la Bellone","address_street_name":"Vlaamsesteenweg","address_street_number":"46","address_street_box":null,"email":"infos@bellone.be","website":"http:\/\/www.bellone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 513 33 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Vlaamsesteenweg, 46","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Bellone, Huis voor de Podiumkunsten, wijdt zich aan het sc\u00e8negebeuren ( toneel, dans, opera, circus, performance...) en is gelegen in het centrum van Brussel. Het middelpunt van de activiteiten is een binnenplaats overkoepeld door een glazen dak, die bescherming geeft aan een merkwaardige voorgevel, gebouwd in het begin van de 18e eeuw door Jan Cosyn, bouwer \u2013 beeldhouwer van de Grote Markt. La Bellone is een forum en een vitrine voor de levende kunst. Het huis fungeert als centrum voor levend geheugen met permanente diensten, zoals het documentatiecentrum voor toneel, en met tal van evenementen, unieke ontmoetingen met kunstenaars. La Bellone brengt verschillende publicaties uit, waaronder het driemaandelijkse blad Sc\u00e8nes, en huisvest verschillende verenigingen verbonden met de podiumkunsten.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":10,"location":{"lat":50.85135235,"lon":4.34638954},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":279041,"translations":{"de"