":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558477"},"fr":{"name":"Presque Hamlet","shortdescr":"Le probl\u00e8me quand on joue Hamlet tout seul, c\u2019est les autres personnages. Il y a un seul personnage avec lequel on peut jouer, c\u2019est le spectre puisqu\u2019il est invisible.","longdescr":"Trag\u00e9die et com\u00e9die sont les deux faces d\u2019une m\u00eame pi\u00e8ce, et Presque Hamlet en apporte la preuve \u00e9clatante. Dans une conf\u00e9rence-spectacle d\u00e9jant\u00e9e, Gilles Privat, silhouette \u00e0 la Jacques Tati, d\u00e9cortique une des pi\u00e8ces les plus embl\u00e9matiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre \u00e9lisab\u00e9thain, y \u00e9tablissant math\u00e9matiquement que le mot \u00ab mort \u00bb constitue la cl\u00e9 de vo\u00fbte du chef-d\u2019\u0153uvre, aid\u00e9, dans sa d\u00e9monstration loufoque, d\u2019un service \u00e0 th\u00e9. Il manipule la substantifique moelle du classique et ne recule devant aucune fac\u00e9tie pour enrichir un discours aussi passionnant que caduque.\r\nPresque Hamlet c\u2019est la d\u00e9claration d\u2019un amour inconditionnel au jeu, qui m\u00eale stand-up et incarnation d\u00e9sopilante, glissant du cin\u00e9ma muet \u00e0 la marionnette, du th\u00e9\u00e2tre d\u2019objet \u00e0 la pantomime, de la com\u00e9die \u00e0 trag\u00e9die, de la connerie au s\u00e9rieux, entre hommage au th\u00e9\u00e2tre et autoportrait en creux.\r\nActeur f\u00e9tiche de trois monuments de la mise en sc\u00e8ne, Benno Besson, Matthias Langhoff et Alain Fran\u00e7on, Gilles Privat et son comp\u00e8re Dan Jemmett remontent vingt-deux ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, un spectacle qui n\u2019a pas pris la moindre ride.","performers":"texte Dan Jemmett & Gilles Privat d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare | jeu Gilles Privat | r\u00e9gie lumi\u00e8re & son Lo\u00efc Rivoalan, William Fournier | r\u00e9gie plateau Gr\u00e9goire de Saint Sauveur, Mitch Croptier | assistanat \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne Lola Riccaboni | sc\u00e9nographie & mise en sc\u00e8ne Dan Jemmett","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558477"},"sp":{"name":"Presque Hamlet","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558477"},"nl":{"name":"Presque Hamlet","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be","email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 223 32 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.558477"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc de Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\r\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\r\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\r\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\r\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\r\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\r\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est\u2026\r\n-\tUn des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs\r\n-\tUn rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle\r\n-\t4 espaces bien distincts (Hall, Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle)\r\n-\tUne salle de spectacle de 800 places\r\n-\tUn gradin r\u00e9tractable de 172 places\r\n-\t200 activit\u00e9s par an\r\n-\t600 artistes par saison\r\n-\t60.000 spectateurs par an\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Ukkel","address_street_name":"Rodestraat","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rodestraat, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":320,"location":{"lat":50.80103183,"lon":4.34237168},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:26+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":231711,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Martyrs","address_street_name":"Place des Martyrs","address_street_number":"22","address_street_box":null,"email":"billetterie@theatre-martyrs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatre-martyrs.be",