ter"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"pt":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"en":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"it":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"cn":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"fr":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":"On les nomme parfois \u201cagent d\u2019entretien\u201d, \u201cfemmes de m\u00e9nage\u201d, \u201ctechniciennes de surface\u201d.  Aujourd\u2019hui, elles prennent la parole. Qu\u2019est-ce qui est essentiel ? Qui prend soin de qui ? Qui nettoie le monde ?","longdescr":"6 femmes, 6 com\u00e9diennes vous invitent \u00e0 leur table pour un repas particulier o\u00f9 la nourriture propos\u00e9e sera celle du jeu, des histoires, des corps et des voix en pr\u00e9sence. \nDans cette exp\u00e9rience th\u00e9\u00e2trale singuli\u00e8re et devant un public complice, elles nous racontent leurs rapports au soin et questionnent le monde : \nQu\u2019est-ce qui fait travail ? Qu\u2019est-ce qui est essentiel ? Qui prend soin de qui ? Qui nettoie le monde ?\n\nDes Roses et du Pain, c\u2019est leur n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 de \u00ab dire \u00bb enfin ce qu\u2019elles taisent depuis longtemps, de raconter des histoires individuelles et collectives, une histoire d\u2019\u00e9mancipation transformatrice. \nElles seront tour \u00e0 tour femmes de m\u00e9nage, infirmi\u00e8res, m\u00e8res et filles, po\u00e9tesses du quotidien, dominantes et domin\u00e9es, cuisini\u00e8res et s\u0153urs de luttes. \n\nElles nous racontent aussi le manque de reconnaissance, celui de la pr\u00e9carit\u00e9. La douleur des corps, la passion, l\u2019impuissance. Jusqu\u2019aux rapports de classe et de \u201craces\u201d \u00e0 l\u2019\u0153uvre dans la mondialisation.","performers":"Compagnie Esp\u00e8ces De \u2026","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"sp":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"},"nl":{"name":"Des Roses et du Pain","shortdescr":"Ze worden soms \u201cconci\u00ebrge\", \"poetsvrouwen\", \"oppervlaktetechnici\" genoemd.  Vandaag spreken ze zich uit. Wat is essentieel? Wie zorgt voor wie? Wie maakt de wereld schoon?\n","longdescr":"6 vrouwen, 6 actrices nodigen u uit aan hun tafel voor een bijzondere maaltijd waar het aangeboden voedsel de aanwezigheid van dat van het spel, de verhalen, lichamen en stemmen zal zijn. \n\nIn deze unieke theatrale ervaring en voor een publiek van handlangers vertellen ze over hun verhouding tot zorg en stellen ze de wereld in vraag: \nWat is werk? Wat is essentieel? Wie zorgt voor wie? Wie maakt de wereld schoon?\n\nDes Roses et du Pain gaat over hun behoefte om eindelijk te \"zeggen\" waarover ze lang hebben gezwegen, om individuele en collectieve verhalen te vertellen, een verhaal van transformerende emancipatie. \nZij zijn beurtelings poetsvrouwen, verpleegsters, moeders en dochters, dichteressen van het alledaagse, dominant en gedomineerd, kokkinnen en zusters in de strijd. \n\nZe vertellen ook over het gebrek aan erkenning, van het precaire. De pijn van het lichaam, de passie, de machteloosheid. En zelfs over de klasse- en \"ras\"-verhoudingen die in de globalisering aan het werk zijn.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/famefestival.be\/fr\/fame-event\/des-roses-et-du-pain\/","email":"info@famefestival.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000477"}},"place":{"id":271867,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel et Sportif Tour \u00e0 Plomb","address_street_name":"rue de l'Abattoir","address_street_number":"20-26","address_street_box":null,"email":"touraplomb@brucity.be","website":"https:\/\/touraplomb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 59 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de l'Abattoir, 20-26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel et Sportif Tour \u00e0 Plomb","address_street_name":"rue de l'Abattoir","address_street_number":"20-26","address_street_box":null,"email":"touraplomb@brucity.be","website":"https:\/\/touraplomb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 59 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de l'Abattoir, 20-26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel et Sportif Tour \u00e0 Plomb","address_street_name":"rue de l'Abattoir","address_street_number":"20-26","address_street_box":null,"email":"touraplomb@brucity.be","website":"https:\/\/touraplomb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 59 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de l'Abattoir, 20-26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The Tour \u00e0 Plomb Center is a neighborhood center of the Youth Service of the City of Brussels, dedicated to various forms of reflection, expression and creation, whether cultural, socio-cultural, artistic or sporting. As a neighborhood infrastructure, the Tour \u00e0 Plomb is first and foremost available to the residents of Brussels and more specifically to the residents and organized groups (non-profit associations, public services and institutions...) of the Jardin aux Fleurs neighborhood.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel et Sportif Tour \u00e0 Plomb","address_street_name":"rue de l'Abattoir","address_street_number":"20-26","address_street_box":null,"email":"touraplomb@brucity.be","website":"https:\/\/touraplomb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 59 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de l'Abattoir, 20-26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":nul