\n\r\nPoetik Bazar, Brussels\u2019 bilingual (French\/Dutch) poetry market, returns for a third edition from 22-24 September 2023 and it will be calling Les Halles home.\r\nAt the market, you\u2019ll find poetry publishers from Belgium, France, the Netherlands and Quebec, this year\u2019s special guest. There will be poetry goodies of every kind: books, magazines, fanzines, self-publications, illustrated works and more.\r\nAlongside that, we offer a rich and multilingual programme of meet-and-greets, readings, workshops for all ages, signings, poetry evenings and other events to help you (re)discover the vitality of the contemporary poetry scene. What could be better than poetry to kick off our new season?!","performers":"Tanella Boni, Guy Goffette, Susinukke Kosola, Diana Anphimiadi, Sara Eelen, Simone Atangana, Doina Ioanid, Lisette Lomb\u00e9, Mustafa K\u00f6r, Camille Bloomfield, Daniele Manno, Collectif SpeakEasy, Antoine Mouton, Erik Solvanger, Dirk Terryn, Fran\u00e7ois Massut, Anna Serra, Pieter Delfosse, Mimi Kunz...","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poetikbazar.be","email":"reservation@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559797"},"it":{"name":"Poetik Bazar #3","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poetikbazar.be","email":"reservation@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559797"},"cn":{"name":"Poetik Bazar #3","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poetikbazar.be","email":"reservation@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559797"},"fr":{"name":"Poetik Bazar #3","shortdescr":"Poetik Bazar, march\u00e9 de la po\u00e9sie de Bruxelles I Po\u00ebziemarkt van Brussel","longdescr":"Le temps d\u2019un long week-end, vivez au rythme de la po\u00e9sie !\r\n\r\nPoetik Bazar, march\u00e9 de la po\u00e9sie bilingue de Bruxelles, revient pour une troisi\u00e8me \u00e9dition du 22 au 24 septembre 2023 et s\u2019installe aux Halles. Sur le march\u00e9, retrouvez des \u00e9diteur\u00b7ices de po\u00e9sie de Belgique, France, Suisse, des Pays-Bas et du Qu\u00e9bec, invit\u00e9 central cette ann\u00e9e. Vous y trouverez des objets po\u00e9tiques en tous genres : livres, revues, fanzines, micro\u00e9ditions, illustrations et autres. En parall\u00e8le, une programmation riche et multilingue : rencontres, lectures, ateliers pour tous les \u00e2ges, d\u00e9dicaces, soir\u00e9es et autres \u00e9v\u00e9nements pour vous faire (re)d\u00e9couvrir la vitalit\u00e9 de la sc\u00e8ne po\u00e9tique contemporaine. Quoi de mieux que la po\u00e9sie pour d\u00e9marrer la saison !","performers":"Tanella Boni, Guy Goffette, Susinukke Kosola, Diana Anphimiadi, Sara Eelen, Simone Atangana, Doina Ioanid, Lisette Lomb\u00e9, Mustafa K\u00f6r, Camille Bloomfield, Daniele Manno, Collectif SpeakEasy, Antoine Mouton, Erik Solvanger, Dirk Terryn, Fran\u00e7ois Massut, Anna Serra, Pieter Delfosse, Mimi Kunz...","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poetikbazar.be","email":"reservation@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559797"},"sp":{"name":"Poetik Bazar #3","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poetikbazar.be","email":"reservation@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559797"},"nl":{"name":"Poetik Bazar #3","shortdescr":"Poetik Bazar, Po\u00ebziemarkt van Brussel I march\u00e9 de la po\u00e9sie de Bruxelles","longdescr":"Leef een weekend lang op het ritme van de po\u00ebzie!\r\n\r\nPoetik Bazar, de tweetalige po\u00ebziemarkt van Brussel, keert terug voor een derde editie van 22 tot 24 september 2023 enstrijkt neer in de Hallen.\r\nOp deze markt vindt u po\u00ebzie-uitgevers uit Belgi\u00eb, Frankrijk, Nederland en Quebec, de centrale gast van dit jaar. U zal er po\u00ebtische objecten ontdekken in alle genres zoals boeken, tijdschriften, fanzines, micropublicaties, illustraties en veel meer.\r\nDaarnaast loopt er een rijk en meertalig programma: ontmoetingen, voordrachten, workshops voor alle leeftijden, signeersessies, avondvoorstellingen en andere evenementen om u de vitaliteit van de hedendaagse po\u00ebzie te laten (her)ontdekken. Wat is een betere manier om het seizoen te beginnen dan met po\u00ebzie!","performers":"Tanella Boni, Guy Goffette, Susinukke Kosola, Diana Anphimiadi, Sara Eelen, Simone Atangana, Doina Ioanid, Lisette Lomb\u00e9, Mustafa K\u00f6r, Camille Bloomfield, Daniele Manno, Collectif SpeakEasy, Antoine Mouton, Erik Solvanger, Dirk Terryn, Fran\u00e7ois Massut, Anna Serra, Pieter Delfosse, Mimi Kunz...","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.poetikbazar.be","email":"reservation@halles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+ 32 (0)2 218 21 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559797"}},"place":{"id":393,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek haben sich Unabh\u00e4ngigkeit und Unkonventionalit\u00e4t auf die Fahnen geschrieben. Untergebracht ist dieser hohe Ort der Kultur in einer fantastisch renovierten Glas- und Metallstruktur aus dem Jahr 1901. Auf dem Programm stehen k\u00fcnstlerische und menschliche Abenteuer und Projekte abseits der Norm...\r\n\r\nHier werden immer wieder neue Formen der B\u00fchnenkunst erfunden, die \u00fcber die klassische Partition zwischen Kunst- und Theaterschaffenden auf der einen Seite und dem Publikum auf der anderen Seite hinausgehen. \r\n\r\nAuf dem Programm - zwischen dem Stadtviertel und der weiten Welt - steht nicht weniger und nicht mehr als das Beste eines Europas, das unabl\u00e4ssig auf der Suche nach seiner Zukunft ist - Erforschung neuer Leidenschaften, Vernunft auf der Suche nach dem Abenteuer, gr\u00f6\u00dfte stilistische Freiheit... Das alles mit Darbietungen, die aus dem Rahmen fallen, und Eigenproduktionen, die unter anderem von den vier Truppen der Halles de Schaerbeek auf die Beine gestellt werden.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles showcase their independence right in the heart of Brussels, the European capital, in a metal and glass structure dating back to 1901, which has been saved from destruction and wonderfully renovated. Its space is unrivalled and perfectly suited for celebrations, extraordinary projects, as well as both artistic and human adventures. Ever since their beginnings, Les Halles have captured and crystallised movements stemming right from the edges of art and society, in an unprecedented alliance of both learned and popular culture. \r\n\r\nIt is an ideal space to create new performative formats, going beyond the classic partition between creators and spectators. Unconcerned with the barriers separating disciplines, willing to shake up the norms, Les Halles resonate with a desire for participation and involvment, be it individually or collectively, thus characterising the digital age. \r\n\r\nOpen to contemporary hopes and upheavals spanning from the neighbourhood right out to the world at large, Les Halles keep on looking for what Europe, still on a quest for its own destiny, has to offer: exploration of new passions, reason seeking out adventure, the utmost freedom of style.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Les Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Lieu intempestif, Les Halles abritent leur ind\u00e9pendance au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, capitale de l\u2019Europe, dans une structure de m\u00e9tal et de verre datant de 1901 et superbement r\u00e9nov\u00e9e.\r\nSes volumes sans \u00e9quivalent invitent aux f\u00eates, aux projets hors normes, aux aventures artistiques et humaines : depuis l\u2019origine, les Halles captent et cristallisent les mouvements de fond de l\u2019art et de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9, dans une alliance in\u00e9dite du savant et du populaire.\r\n\r\nElles offrent un espace id\u00e9al pour r\u00e9inventer les formes du spectacle, au-del\u00e0 de la classique partition entre cr\u00e9ateurs d\u2019un c\u00f4t\u00e9 et spectateurs de l\u2019autre. Bousculant les usages, Les Halles r\u00e9sonnent avec l\u2019envie de participation et d\u2019engagement, \u00e9gotiste ou collectif, qui caract\u00e9rise l\u2019\u00e9poque num\u00e9rique.\r\n\r\nOuvertes aux espoirs et aux bouleversements contemporains, du quartier jusqu\u2019au grand large du monde, elles cherchent \u00e0 retrouver le meilleur d\u2019une Europe toujours en qu\u00eate de son destin : l\u2019exploration de passions nouvelles,  la raison cherchant l\u2019aventure, la plus grande libert\u00e9 d\u2019allure.\r\n\r\n A c\u00f4t\u00e9 d\u2019une programmation traditionnelle, les Halles d\u00e9veloppent des temps atypiques sur de grands week-ends et engagent des projets qui sortent du champ strict du spectacle vivant. Les Halles, d\u2019autre part, lancent des productions propres, notamment avec les quatre compagnies associ\u00e9es au lieu.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles de Schaerbeek","address_street_name":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Rue Royale Sainte-Marie","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles exhibe su independencia en el coraz\u00f3n de Bruselas, la capital europea, en una estructura de metal y vidrio que data de 1901, que se salv\u00f3 de la destrucci\u00f3n y se renov\u00f3 maravillosamente. Su espacio es incomparable y se adapta perfectamente a celebraciones, proyectos extraordinarios y aventuras tanto art\u00edsticas como humanas. Desde sus inicios, el centro Les Halles ha capturado y cristalizado movimientos provenientes de los l\u00edmites del arte y la sociedad, en una alianza sin precedentes de cultura tanto erudita como popular. \r\nEs un espacio ideal para crear nuevos formatos performativos, yendo m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de la partici\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica entre creadores y espectadores. Sin preocuparse por las barreras que separan las disciplinas, dispuesta a sacudir las normas, Les Halles resuena con un deseo de participaci\u00f3n e implicaci\u00f3n, ya sea de manera individual o colectiva, caracterizando as\u00ed la era digital.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hallen van Schaarbeek","address_street_name":"Koninklijke Sint-Mariastraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@halles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.halles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 21 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 21 07","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Koninklijke Sint-Mariastraat","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Les Halles werken aan een multidisciplinair, hedendaags en internationaal artistiek project dat deze instelling een bijzondere plaats geeft binnen de hedendaagse creatieve sc\u00e8ne in Brussel.\r\nLes Halles vormen een buitengewone culturele plek, zowel door de ruimtes als door de artistieke voorstellen.die een kruising zijn tussen dans, circus, podiumkunsten en muzikale optredens. \r\n\r\nLes Halles dragen de hedendaagse creatieve sc\u00e8ne een warm hart toe. Les Halles proberen zinvolle, artistiek vernieuwende projecten tot stand te brengen. In die zin wordt de kunstenaars de mogelijkheid geboden hun tijd te nemen, te experimenteren en te zoeken.\r\n\r\nLes Halles slaan een brug tussen een communautair engagement en de creatieve sc\u00e8ne op Europees niveau. Ze spelen een essenti\u00eble rol in de confrontatie van verschillende culturen, talen en benaderingen in Brussel. De aanwezigheid van Europese projecten is een van de draagvlakken van les halles. Zowel voor de toeschouwers als voor de kunstenaars van bij ons pogen les Halles de Brusselse sc\u00e8ne open te trekken en het publiek kennis te laten maken met vernieuwende, artistieke bewegingen die zich elders hebben ontwikkeld.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":106,"location":{"lat":50.85994245,"lon":4.36947808},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:17+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":59,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Midis de la Po\u00e9sie","address_street_name":