,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"de":["Theater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Theatre"],"it":["Teatro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"sp":["Teatro"],"nl":["Theater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"pt":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"en":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"it":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"cn":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"fr":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":"Les choix et les sacrifices d\u2019un artiste d\u2019exception de la BD qui aimait sortir de sa case.\r\n","longdescr":"Avant d\u2019entrer dans l\u2019histoire de la BD avec Gil Jourdan \u2013 un d\u00e9tective priv\u00e9 maladroit et attachant \u2013 Maurice Tillieux, auteur majeur de l\u2019\u00e9cole belge du neuvi\u00e8me Art conna\u00eet des d\u00e9buts modestes. Tout au long de sa carri\u00e8re, il rencontrera des difficult\u00e9s, notamment lorsqu\u2019il dut abandonner son travail de dessinateur pour travailler comme marin afin de subvenir aux besoins de sa famille. La pi\u00e8ce est un hommage poignant \u00e0 la vie et l\u2019\u0153uvre remarquables du ma\u00eetre du r\u00e9cit policier d\u2019humour et d\u2019atmosph\u00e8re qui, fin des ann\u00e9es 60, r\u00e9gnait sur le Journal de Spirou comme Goscinny sur Pilote ou Greg sur Tintin. La pi\u00e8ce rappelle que la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et l\u2019innovation sont des qualit\u00e9s pr\u00e9cieuses mais pas toujours r\u00e9compens\u00e9es \u00e0 leur juste valeur. Un spectacle \u00e0 voir pour tous ceux qui s\u2019int\u00e9ressent \u00e0 la BD, \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et \u00e0 l\u2019art en g\u00e9n\u00e9ral. Aux artistes, en particulier. \r\n","performers":"De\u202fMarc Hendrickx, Dirk Dobbeleers\r\nMise en sc\u00e8ne\u202fYoeri Lewijze\r\nAvec Marc Weiss, Yoeri Lewijze, Sam Brosens ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"sp":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"},"nl":{"name":"Tillieux","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559915"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc de Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\r\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\r\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\r\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\r\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\r\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\r\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est\u2026\r\n-\tUn des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs\r\n-\tUn rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle\r\n-\t4 espaces bien distincts (Hall, Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle)\r\n-\tUne salle de spectacle de 800 places\r\n-\tUn gradin r\u00e9tractable de 172 places\r\n-\t200 activit\u00e9s par an\r\n-\t600 artistes par saison\r\n-\t60.000 spectateurs par an\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Ukkel","address_street_name":"Rodestraat","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rodestraat, 47","address_line2":"118