 15 a\u00f1os"],"nl":["Kinderen 6-9 j.","Kinderen 9-12 j.","Familie","Senioren","Jongeren 12-15 j."]}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["kids"]},{"id":50001247,"date_start":"2023-09-24","date_end":"2023-09-24","date_next":"2023-09-24","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2023-08-25T10:30:01+02:00","published_at":"2023-08-24T08:37:27+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":283812,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Klassisch"],"pt":[null],"en":["Classical"],"it":["Classica"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Classique"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"nl":["Klassiek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"pt":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"en":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Dance! Dance!! Dance!!! Classical music that will make you want to move.\n\n \n","longdescr":"Dance! Dance!! Dance!!! Classical music that will make you want to move.  \n\nFrom Chopin's Waltz, the Polish Parisian,\nto the Spanish Fandango of Granados,\npassing by the Manly Dance of Ginastera the Argentinian\nand the Estonian composer Sumera's dance dripping with typically Baltic humor... all this interpreted by the delicate and feverish hands of the pianist Yu-Fen Chang,Taiwanese-Belgian \u2013 A moment to catch our breath...! \nAnd we will pass towards the Belgian-Hungarian Nikolaas Kende who will move us from Bach's suites to Mozart's minuet, from Brahms' waltzes to Chopin \u2026 to Tchaikovsky's swans to finish with, forgive the word \u201cDavidsbundlertanze\u201d by Schumann.\n\n If we complete with a Polish Brussels resident, Szymon Brzoska with his \u201cmurmurs\u201d,\ncontemporary dance music used by Sidi Larbi Cherkaoui, international Antwerp choreographer, performed by Isaak Duerinck. \n\n 3 + = no less than 3 +\u2019s so 3 surprises \u2026\n\n   We look forward to seeing you there.... And don't forget that performances begin or continue at the Tricoterie's caf\u00e9-restaurant, which is open until 11 p.m. on Sundays. \n","performers":" Yu-Fen Chang (pianist) - Nikolaas Kende (pianist) - Isaak Duerinck (dancer)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"it":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"cn":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"fr":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! du classique qui vous donnera envie de vous remuer. \n\n","longdescr":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! du classique qui vous donnera envie de vous remuer. \n\nDe la Valse de Chopin, le parisien polonais, au Fandango espagnol de Granados,\nen passant par la Danse virile de Ginastera l\u2019argentin et encore le compositeur estonien Sumera aux danses remplies d\u2019humour typiquement baltes... tout cela interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 par les mains d\u00e9licates et f\u00e9briles de la pianiste Yu-Fen Chang, qui est taiwanaise-belge - Inspirons, reprenons notre souffle....!\nNous passerons aux mains du belgo-hongrois Nikolaas Kende qui nous fera bouger des suites de Bach au menuet de Mozart, des valses de Brahms, de Chopin au cygnes de Tcha\u00efkovski pour finir avec, pardonnez le mot \u201cDavidsbundlertanze\u201d de Schumann.\n\nSi on compl\u00e8te par un bruxellois polonais, Szymon Brzoska avec ses \u201cmurmurs\u201d,\nmusique dansante contemporaine utilis\u00e9e par Sidi Larbi Cherkaoui, chor\u00e9graphe anversois international, interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 par Isaak Duerinck. \n\nEn +: pas moins que 3 plus, 3 surprises donc\u2026 toujours \u201c+\u201d\n\n  Nous vous attendons avec impatience... Et n\u2019oubliez pas que les spectacles commencent ou se poursuivent au bar et restaurant de la Tricoterie, ouvert dimanche Jusqu'\u00e0 23h00 \n","performers":"  Yu-Fen Chang (pianiste) -  Nikolaas Kende (pianiste) -  Isaak Duerinck (danseur)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"sp":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"},"nl":{"name":"Dance ! Dance !! Dance !!! + by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Dans! Dans!! Dans!!! klassiek die ervoor zorgt dat je wilt bewegen.","longdescr":"Dans! Dans!! Dans!!! klassiek die ervoor zorgt dat je wilt bewegen. \n\nVan de wals van Chopin, de Poolse Parijzenaar, tot aan de Spaanse Fandango van Granados,\n\nlangs de viriele dans van Ginastera de Argentijn, en dan weer de Estse componist Sumera dansend met typisch Baltische humor... \ndit alles vertolkt door de tere, koortsachtige handen van de Taiwanees-Belgische pianiste Yu-Fen Chang - Even op adem komen.. inademen..! \ngaan we over in de Belgisch-Hongaarse handen van Nikolaas Kende van de suites van Bach naar het menuet van Mozart, van de walsen van Brahms en Chopin naar de zwanen van Tsjaikovski om af te sluiten met, vergeef het woord, \u201cDavidsbundlertanze\u201d van Schumann.\n\nWe het af met een Poolse Brusselaar, Szymon Brzoska\u2019s \u201cMurmurs\u201d, hedendaagse dansmuziek gebruikt door Sidi Larbi Cherkaoui, internationaal Antwerpse choreograaf, vertolkt door Isaak Duerinck. \n\n3 +sen: 3 verrassingen dus \u2026\n\n  We kijken ernaar uit om je daar te zien.... En vergeet niet dat de voorstellingen beginnen of doorgaan in caf\u00e9-restaurant van de Tricoterie, dat op zondag tot 23.00 uur open is. \n","performers":" Yu-Fen Chang (pianist) - Nikolaas Kende (pianist) - Isaak Duerinck (danser)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/dance-dance-dance","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001247"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_up