tions":{"de":"Animationen","pt":null,"en":"Animations","it":"Animazioni","cn":null,"fr":"Animations","sp":"Animaciones","nl":"Animaties"}},"others":{"list":[99],"translations":{"de":["Gastronomie"],"pt":[null],"en":["Gastronomy"],"it":["Cucina"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Gastronomie"],"sp":["Gastronom\u00eda"],"nl":["Gastronomie"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/fr","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"pt":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/fr","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"en":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch","shortdescr":"Discover The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch every month! Enjoy a luxurious brunch with friends and family. In September, the brunch will take place by combining the Design September event.","longdescr":"An extraordinary experience by blending design and brunch during the renowned Brussels event, Design September. Indulge in exquisite cuisine surrounded by art pieces throughout the hotel.\n\nUnforgettable moments await, reserve now and be part of this remarkable event.\nAt The Dominican, there is a unique brunch experience to enjoy an extensive buffet of delicious dishes and all-inclusive drinks. Whether there is a special occasion to celebrate or simply want to enjoy a relaxing Sunday afternoon, brunch is the perfect choice.\n\nIndulge and enjoy a selection of culinary delights. All this is surrounded by an exclusive ambiance and atmospheric live music, completing the overall experience. The brunch is also kid-friendly, with animated entertainment to keep the little ones occupied, making it a fun experience for the whole family.\nThe Dominican wants brunch to be a special occasion, a time to relax, enjoy and create great memories.\n\nThe price for The Dominican Exclusive Brunch is 75 euros per person, which includes an extensive sweet and savory buffet and includes all drinks. Upon arrival you can enjoy a glass of bubbly and during the brunch there will also be 3 cocktails, fresh juices, wines, beers, water, soft drinks, coffee and tea. There is a 50% discount for children under the age of 12 so that they too can enjoy this special experience.\n\nDon't wait any longer and experience an unforgettable brunch together at The Dominican. Book now and enjoy delicious food, excellent service and a warm atmosphere that will linger long after.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/exclusive-sunday-brunch","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"it":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/fr","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"cn":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/fr","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"fr":{"name":"The Dominican Brunch exclusif du dimanche","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez chaque mois le Brunch exclusif du dimanche au The Dominican ! Venez profiter de brunch luxueux avec vos amis et votre famille. En septembre, en collaboration avec Design September, le brunch lance...","longdescr":"Au The Dominican, nous vous offrons une exp\u00e9rience de brunch unique, vous permettant de savourer un buffet de d\u00e9licieux plats \u00e9labor\u00e9s par notre chef talentueux. Que vous c\u00e9l\u00e9briez une occasion sp\u00e9ciale ou que vous souhaitiez simplement profiter d'un dimanche apr\u00e8s-midi d\u00e9tendu, notre brunch est le choix id\u00e9al.\n\nLaissez vos papilles gustatives \u00eatre choy\u00e9es avec une s\u00e9lection de d\u00e9lices culinaires. Pendant que vous d\u00e9gustez votre repas, plongez dans une ambiance exclusive accom-pagn\u00e9e de musique live, contribuant \u00e0 l'exp\u00e9rience globale. Notre brunch est \u00e9gale-ment adapt\u00e9 aux enfants, avec des animations pour divertir les plus petits, offrant ainsi une exp\u00e9rience agr\u00e9able pour toute la famille.\n\nAu The Dominican, nous croyons que le brunch doit \u00eatre une occasion sp\u00e9ciale, un moment pour se d\u00e9tendre, profiter et cr\u00e9er des souvenirs pr\u00e9cieux.\nLe prix du Brunch exclusif du The Dominican est de 75 euros par personne, comprenant un vaste choix de mets sucr\u00e9s et sal\u00e9s, ainsi que toutes les boissons \u00e0 volont\u00e9. \u00c0 votre arriv\u00e9e, vous pourrez d\u00e9guster une coupe de bulles, et tout au long du brunch, nous servons \u00e9galement 3 cocktails, des jus frais, des vins, des bi\u00e8res, de l'eau, des boissons non alcoolis\u00e9es, du caf\u00e9 et du th\u00e9. Les enfants jusqu'\u00e0 12 ans b\u00e9n\u00e9ficient d'u-ne r\u00e9duction de 50 %, afin qu'ils puissent eux aussi profiter de cette exp\u00e9rience excep-tionnelle.\n\nN'attendez plus et rejoignez-nous pour un brunch inoubliable au The Dominican. R\u00e9servez votre table et laissez-nous vous r\u00e9galer avec une cuisine d\u00e9licieuse, un service excellent et une atmosph\u00e8re chaleureuse qui restera grav\u00e9e dans vos souvenirs pen-dant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/fr","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"sp":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/fr","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"},"nl":{"name":"The Dominican Exclusieve zondagbrunch","shortdescr":"Ontdek iedere maand The Dominican Exclusive Sunday Brunch! Geniet van een luxueuze brunch met vrienden en familie. In september gaat de brunch van start in combinatie met het evenement Design September.","longdescr":"Een buitengewone ervaring door design en brunch te combineren tijdens het bekende Brusselse evenement Design September. Geniet van een voortreffelijke gerechten omringd door kunst in het hele hotel.\n\nEr staan je onvergetelijke momenten te wachten, reserveer nu en maak deel uit van dit bijzondere evenement.\nBij The Dominican is er een unieke brunchervaring om te genieten van een uitgebreid buffet met heerlijke gerechten en dranken all-inclusive. Of er nu een speciale gelegenheid te vieren is of simpelweg wilt genieten van een ontspannen zondagmiddag, dan is brunchen de perfecte keuze.\n\nVerwen en geniet van een selectie van culinaire hoogstandjes. Dit alles wordt omringd door een exclusieve ambiance en sfeervolle livemuziek, wat de algehele ervaring compleet maakt. De brunch is ook kindvriendelijk, met geanimeerd entertainment om de kleintjes bezig te houden, waardoor het een leuke ervaring wordt voor het hele gezin.\n\nThe Dominican wil dat brunchen een speciale gelegenheid is, een moment om te ontspannen, te genieten en mooie herinneringen te cre\u00ebren.\nDe prijs voor The Dominican Exclusive Brunch is 75 euro per persoon, inclusief een uitgebreid zoet en hartig buffet en inclusief alle drankjes. Bij aankomst kun je genieten van een glas bubbels en tijdens de brunch worden er ook 3 cocktails, verse sappen, wijnen, bieren, water, frisdranken, koffie en thee geserveerd. Voor kinderen onder de 12 jaar is er een korting van 50%, zodat ook zij kunnen genieten van deze speciale ervaring.\n\nWacht niet langer en beleef samen een onvergetelijke brunch bij The Dominican. Reserveer nu en geniet van heerlijk eten, uitstekende service en een warme sfeer die nog lang zal nazinderen.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/nl","email":"info@thedominican.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50001408"}},"place":{"id":263103,"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.be","website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold, 9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.be","website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold, 9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"The Dominican","address_street_name":"Rue L\u00e9opold","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@thedominican.be","website":"https:\/\/thedominican.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 08 08","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 08 08","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue L\u00e9opold, 9","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The Dominican, first member of Design Hotels\u2122 in Belgium, is a destination for elegance in the centre of Brussels. Situated behind the theatre La Monnaie, off Grand Place, its 150 stylish rooms, 3 multifunctional meeting rooms, private courtyard and animated Lounge Bar combine to ensure indulgent hospitality.\r\nThe award-winning architects of FG Stijl and LENS\u00ba ASS, have created an eclectic mix of design in both the interior and exterior, resulting in an array of new styles and experiences.\r\nThe 150 guestrooms and suites \u2013 everyone with an individual look \u2013 are located around a quiet courtyard and have a rich blend of contemporary design and luxurious textiles, offering quiet comfort in a cloister-like setting.","description_print":"The Dominican, first member of Design Hotels\u2122 in Belgium, is a destination for elegance in the centre of Brussels. Situated behind the theatre La Monnaie, off Grand Place, its 150 stylish rooms, 3 multifunctional meeting rooms, private courtyard and animated Lounge Bar combine to ensure indulgent hospitality.\r\nThe award-winning architects of FG Stijl and LENS\u00ba ASS, have created an eclectic mix of design in both the interior and exterior, resulting in an array of new styles and experiences.\r\nThe 150 guestrooms and suites \u2013 everyone with an individual look \u2013 are located around a quiet courtyard and have a rich blend of contemporary design and luxurious textiles, offering quiet comfort in a cloister-like setting.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"The Dominican","add