e9.","longdescr":"Illustratie, strips en zines, tekenen en schrijven, knippen en plakken, inkt en papier... In Muntpunt lusten we er wel pap(ier) van! Voor 10 Jaar Muntpunt\u00a0geven we dan ook een groot tekenfeest, voor tekenaars van alle leeftijden en kalibers. Neem plaats aan de feesttafel, pak een stuk papier en laat je creativiteit de vrije loop. Special guests zorgen voor inspiratie.\n\nProgramma\n\n\n14:00 - 17:00 | Paper Party for Kids: Souvenir op Papier, een tekenworkshop voor kinderen (6+) met Robin Hendrix en Nele De Paepe\n14:00 - 16:00 | Zine Club\u00a0met\u00a0Arthur Devisscher\u00a0en\u00a0Simon Baert\n17:00 - 19:00 | Zine Club met\u00a0Nour Hifaoui Fakhoury\u00a0en\u00a0Karen Keyrouz\u00a0 van\u00a0Samandal Comics\n20:00 - 23:00\u00a0| Drawing Fiesta! in het Muntpunt Caf\u00e9, met Aniss El Hamouri, Pom Koolen, dj\u00a0Ferre Marnef\u00a0en\u00a0VROOM\n\n\nA paper \/ a day\nPaper Party is ook het startschot van A paper \/ a day, een online tekenchallenge die elk jaar plaatsvindt in oktober. Volg de Instagram van Kunstwerkt voor inspiratie, ga aan het tekenen en post je tekening met de hashtag #apaperaday2023.\n\nOntdek het volledige programma van 10 Jaar Muntpunt\n\nEN -\u00a0Crazy about drawing? Then you have the right papers for this drawing party: a workshop for children, two Zine Clubs and a Drawing Fiesta with DJ in the Muntpunt Caf\u00e9.\n\nFR - Vous \u00eates fou de dessin ? Alors vous avez les bons papiers pour cette f\u00eate du dessin : un atelier pour les enfants, deux Zine Clubs et une Drawing Fiesta avec DJ au Muntpunt Caf\u00e9.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/icontact.muntpunt.be\/civicrm\/event\/register?reset=1&id=13315","email":"info@muntpunt.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.562672"}},"place":{"id":250926,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Muntpunt est une biblioth\u00e8que, un lieu d'information et de rencontres. Laissez-vous inspirer par des livres, des histoires et des rencontres adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 la capitale. Apprenez tout sur le travail, les \u00e9tudes, et la vie \u00e0 Bruxelles et en Flandre. D\u00e9couvrez la richesse de l' offre culturelle n\u00e9erlandophone des organisations bruxelloises et flamandes.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muntpunt ","address_street_name":"Muntplein","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Muntplein, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Muntpunt is een bibliotheek, informatiehuis, ontmoetingsplek en je venster op Brussel. Laat je inspireren door boeken, verhalen en ontmoetingen op maat van de hoofdstad. Kom meer te weten over wonen, werken, studeren, leven en beleven in Brussel en Vlaanderen. Ontdek het rijke Nederlandstalige culturele en vrijetijdsaanbod van Brusselse en Vlaamse organisaties.\r\n\r\nIn Muntpunt kan je meer dan alleen boeken, cd\u2019s en dvd\u2019s ontlenen. Je kan er ook terecht voor activiteiten, taalcursussen, infosessies, luisterboeken, strips, spelletjes, en nog veel meer. Er valt bijna dagelijks iets te beleven in Muntpunt, van voorlezen tot documentaires, van infosessies tot rondleidingen, voor jong en oud. De activiteiten sluiten aan bij de bibliotheekwerking of spelen in op actuele thema's, steeds met de Brusselse hoofdstedelijke context in het achterhoofd. De rode draad door de programmatie is de samenwerking met Vlaamse en Brusselse partnerorganisaties. \r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13020,"location":{"lat":50.84996484,"lon":4.35348679},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-11-03T17:13:45+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:35:36+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250926,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Pla