m Brussels, Belgium, Europe and far beyond.","longdescr":"BXLBeerFest invites 60 artisan breweries to present their beers during two festival days, Saturday 30\/09 from 12:00 to 22:00 and Sunday 01\/10 from 12:00 to 21:00. Only the best the beer world has to offer, selected by us, served for you. We ensure a perfect tasting moment with freshly cleaned glasses at all times. The breweries will bring their best beers, in all styles, smells and colours. Our unique and spacious hall ensures a pleasant and convivial moment and our outdoor terrace with food trucks for that extra experience. ","performers":"Cantillon, En Stoemelings, Brasserie La Mule, Surr\u00e9aliste, 1Bi\u00e8re2Tartines, La Source, Brasserie De La Senne, Brussels Beer Project, Gueuzerie Tilquin, Boerenerf Eylenbosch, Den Herberg, De Dochter van De Korenaar, Kestemont, DUST Blending, De Meester, Hof ten Dormaal, Levain, P\u00fchaste, Popihn & many others...","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BXLBEERFEST&s=3835236A-6519-B80D-E2A4-CC880E092D19&lg=EN","website":"http:\/\/www.bxlbeerfest.com","email":"kevin@bxlbeerfest.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 477 59 07 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557136"},"it":{"name":"BXLBeerFest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bxlbeerfest.com","email":"kevin@bxlbeerfest.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 477 59 07 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557136"},"cn":{"name":"BXLBeerFest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bxlbeerfest.com","email":"kevin@bxlbeerfest.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 477 59 07 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557136"},"fr":{"name":"BXLBeerFest 2023","shortdescr":"Festival de la bi\u00e8re artisanale pr\u00e9sentant 60 brasseries de Bruxelles, de Belgique, d'Europe et d'ailleurs.","longdescr":"Le BXLBeerFest invite 60 brasseries artisanales \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter leurs bi\u00e8res pendant les deux jours du festival, le samedi 30\/09 de 12h00 \u00e0 22h00 et le dimanche 01\/10 de 12h00 \u00e0 21h00. Le meilleur de ce que le monde de la bi\u00e8re a \u00e0 offrir, s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 par nous, servi pour vous. Nous garantissons un moment de d\u00e9gustation parfait avec des verres fra\u00eechement nettoy\u00e9s \u00e0 tout moment. Les brasseries apporteront leurs meilleures bi\u00e8res, dans tous les styles, toutes les odeurs et toutes les couleurs. Notre salle unique et spacieuse garantit un moment agr\u00e9able et convivial et notre terrasse ext\u00e9rieure avec des food trucks pour une exp\u00e9rience suppl\u00e9mentaire. ","performers":"Cantillon, En Stoemelings, Brasserie La Mule, Surr\u00e9aliste, 1Bi\u00e8re2Tartines, La Source, Brasserie De La Senne, Brussels Beer Project, Gueuzerie Tilquin, Boerenerf Eylenbosch, Den Herberg, De Dochter van De Korenaar, Kestemont, DUST Blending, De Meester, Hof ten Dormaal, Levain, P\u00fchaste, Popihn & many others...","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BXLBEERFEST&s=3835236A-6519-B80D-E2A4-CC880E092D19&lg=FR","website":"http:\/\/www.bxlbeerfest.com","email":"kevin@bxlbeerfest.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 477 59 07 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557136"},"sp":{"name":"BXLBeerFest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bxlbeerfest.com","email":"kevin@bxlbeerfest.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 477 59 07 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557136"},"nl":{"name":"BXLBeerFest 2023","shortdescr":"Artisanaal bierfestival met 60 brouwerijen uit Brussel, Belgi\u00eb, Europa en ver daarbuiten. ","longdescr":"BXLBeerFest nodigt 60 artisanale brouwerijen uit om hun bieren voor te stellen tijdens twee festivaldagen, zaterdag 30\/09 van 12:00 tot 22:00 en zondag 01\/10 van 12:00 tot 21:00. Enkel het beste wat de bierwereld te bieden heeft, geselecteerd door ons, geserveerd voor jullie. We zorgen voor een perfect degustatie moment met steeds vers gereinigde glazen. De brouwerijen brengen hun beste bieren mee, in alle stijlen, geuren en kleuren. Onze unieke en ruime zaal zorgt voor een aangenaam en gemoedelijk moment en ons buitenterras met foodtrucks voor die extra beleving. ","performers":"Cantillon, En Stoemelings, Brasserie La Mule, Surr\u00e9aliste, 1Bi\u00e8re2Tartines, La Source, Brasserie De La Senne, Brussels Beer Project, Gueuzerie Tilquin, Boerenerf Eylenbosch, Den Herberg, De Dochter van De Korenaar, Kestemont, DUST Blending, De Meester, Hof ten Dormaal, Levain, P\u00fchaste, Popihn & many others...","boxoffice_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?module=ACTIVITYSERIEDETAILS&pos=BXLBEERFEST&s=3835236A-6519-B80D-E2A4-CC880E092D19&lg=NL","website":"http:\/\/www.bxlbeerfest.com","email":"kevin@bxlbeerfest.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 477 59 07 37","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.557136"}},"place":{"id":279175,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tour&Taxis - SHED 1","address_street_name":"Picardstraat 3 ","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Picardstraat 3 , 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Tour&Taxis - SHED 1","address_street_name":"Picardstraat 3 ","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Picardstraat 3 , 3","a