. Gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des activit\u00e9s ludiques et apaisantes, les enfants d\u00e9veloppent l'oreille musicale, la coordination corporelle, l'attention, ainsi que la perception du monde qui les entoure. Bas\u00e9 sur l'\u00e9change horizontal entre l'animatrice et les enfants, cet atelier se veut r\u00e9flexif et adapt\u00e9 aux besoins de chacun. C'est un moment de plaisir et de partage o\u00f9 l'on s'amuse avec son corps, sa voix, et des instruments de musique issus des quatre coins du monde.\r\n\r\nL'activit\u00e9 se d\u00e9roule pieds nus ou en chaussettes.\r\n\r\nLocal Th\u00e9atre\r\n\r\nAvec Cecilia Pencanha\r\n\r\nD\u00e9s le 16 septembre, les samedis de 12h00 \u00e0 13h00","performers":"Avec Cecilia Pencanha","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559493"},"sp":{"name":"\u00c9veil Musical","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559493"},"nl":{"name":"\u00c9veil Musical","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559493"}},"place":{"id":220532,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 29","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert"